(2170468, 296650, 33000, '<td valign="top">This one is propably going to be liked by many (male) voters. <br/>There are good things about it and bad things. <br/>Photographicly it''s very good, nice lighting and all but fashion vice it''s not good and I must say that her eyebrows are horrible. I don''t like the nipple showing either. But since this is a photography challenge not a styling challenge I will give it a nice score.</td>', 'This one is propably going to be liked by many (male) voters. There are good things about it and bad things. Photographicly it''s very good, nice lighting and all but fashion vice it''s not good and I must say that her eyebrows are horrible. I don''t like the nipple showing either. But since this is a photography challenge not a styling challenge I will give it a nice score.', '2006-02-22 07:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
