(2170669, 298990, 15711, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Looks like something in an "anthropologie" catalog!  I had this same idea, but couldn''t execute it.  Very nice.</td>', 'Awesome.  Looks like something in an "anthropologie" catalog!  I had this same idea, but couldn''t execute it.  Very nice.', '2006-02-22 08:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
