(2170675, 297318, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the way this is shot with high contrast. Not the typical model, but the way in which you did it is very "fashion."  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the way this is shot with high contrast. Not the typical model, but the way in which you did it is very "fashion."  Nicely done.', '2006-02-22 08:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
