(2170711, 298214, 37879, '<td valign="top">The digital manipulation and speckled lighting across her body don''t work for me.  They seem to distract more than they add to the photo.</td>', 'The digital manipulation and speckled lighting across her body don''t work for me.  They seem to distract more than they add to the photo.', '2006-02-22 08:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
