(2170719, 298562, 37879, '<td valign="top">grosses me out a first glance (looks like a dead hand or paper bag)...absolutely love it at second glace (all natural vs. glamourous)...grosses me out again at third glance...absolutely love it again at fourth glance...let''s stop there</td>', 'grosses me out a first glance (looks like a dead hand or paper bag)...absolutely love it at second glace (all natural vs. glamourous)...grosses me out again at third glance...absolutely love it again at fourth glance...let''s stop there', '2006-02-22 08:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170721, 298441, 32133, '<td valign="top">Really good shot.</td>', 'Really good shot.', '2006-02-22 08:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170726, 296988, 37879, '<td valign="top">wish the model had more powder on her forehead to block the glare, or that the lighting was just a tad softer there...the lines behind her (horizontally) are distracting as is the shadow on the right....love the color, pose &amp; cropping on this one.</td>', 'wish the model had more powder on her forehead to block the glare, or that the lighting was just a tad softer there...the lines behind her (horizontally) are distracting as is the shadow on the right....love the color, pose & cropping on this one.', '2006-02-22 08:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170732, 297120, 37879, '<td valign="top">Eyes frek me out a little.  Can''t tell if the catchlights are huge or if diffuse glow, etc. was used to magnify this.  -9-</td>', 'Eyes frek me out a little.  Can''t tell if the catchlights are huge or if diffuse glow, etc. was used to magnify this.  -9-', '2006-02-22 08:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170733, 298473, 32133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and lighting 9</td>', 'Beautiful colors and lighting 9', '2006-02-22 08:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170742, 296491, 37879, '<td valign="top">The model is beautiful and I love the soft focus, except wish her eyes would remain sharp comparatively speaking.  It makes my eyes twitch to try and figure it out.  I think this would be an awesome image of it were cropped right above her shoulders. (just a minor decapitation  Still, very nice work.  -8-</td>', 'The model is beautiful and I love the soft focus, except wish her eyes would remain sharp comparatively speaking.  It makes my eyes twitch to try and figure it out.  I think this would be an awesome image of it were cropped right above her shoulders. (just a minor decapitation  Still, very nice work.  -8-', '2006-02-22 08:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170744, 297445, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Looks like a magazine layout!! 10</td>', 'Great composition. Looks like a magazine layout!! 10', '2006-02-22 08:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170752, 296600, 37879, '<td valign="top">From personal experience, I know you''ll be getting lots of "it''s too small".  I''m not gonna take that from your score.  However, I am having difficulting understanding how this pertains to fashion.  If it were for the swimming trunks I would think they should be in the picture more.  Looks like a good shot for another challenge.</td>', 'From personal experience, I know you''ll be getting lots of "it''s too small".  I''m not gonna take that from your score.  However, I am having difficulting understanding how this pertains to fashion.  If it were for the swimming trunks I would think they should be in the picture more.  Looks like a good shot for another challenge.', '2006-02-22 09:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170755, 298483, 37879, '<td valign="top">seems to be a bit of an odd color cast in the shadows...nice concept</td>', 'seems to be a bit of an odd color cast in the shadows...nice concept', '2006-02-22 09:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170777, 297120, 15711, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT! Very fashionista.  Looks like a magazine layout!</td>', 'EXCELLENT! Very fashionista.  Looks like a magazine layout!', '2006-02-22 09:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170786, 296915, 37879, '<td valign="top">Nice!  You took this to the next level.</td>', 'Nice!  You took this to the next level.', '2006-02-22 09:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170795, 298990, 37879, '<td valign="top">Wish the crop wasn''t so tight.  Makes it seem like she''s crammed in...but the clothes feel soft...perhaps more appropriate for an open feel with lots of space.  Beautiful lighting and color.</td>', 'Wish the crop wasn''t so tight.  Makes it seem like she''s crammed in...but the clothes feel soft...perhaps more appropriate for an open feel with lots of space.  Beautiful lighting and color.', '2006-02-22 09:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170798, 297364, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I''d say remove the jewelry, as I''m assuming this is supposed to focus on the sunglasses. 8</td>', 'Nicely done.  I''d say remove the jewelry, as I''m assuming this is supposed to focus on the sunglasses. 8', '2006-02-22 09:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170801, 298002, 15711, '<td valign="top">She reminds me of Katie Holmes.  Very fashion-esque!</td>', 'She reminds me of Katie Holmes.  Very fashion-esque!', '2006-02-22 09:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170805, 298759, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very artsy. Nice lighting. I can see this in a salon catalog! 8</td>', 'Very artsy. Nice lighting. I can see this in a salon catalog! 8', '2006-02-22 09:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170807, 297597, 15711, '<td valign="top">Works for me!!!!! 8</td>', 'Works for me!!!!! 8', '2006-02-22 09:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170811, 298584, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very artsy and couture looking.</td>', 'Very artsy and couture looking.', '2006-02-22 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170812, 296547, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the single glint in the right eye. Interesting perspective.</td>', 'I like the single glint in the right eye. Interesting perspective.', '2006-02-22 09:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170813, 298535, 47117, '<td valign="top">This to me is my top scoring photo, and I will play a little bit of Tyra Banks here and say why.  The lighting is very good. The make up is done well. Not over or under done.  The hair is pleasing. The hat and outfit look wonderful on this model. The facial expression is spot on.  The only distraction I see is the thumb. It stands out a bit too much and I would have had her hold that down. Without that, this could go on any make up cover and outshine some of today''s top models. Very nicely done.</td>', 'This to me is my top scoring photo, and I will play a little bit of Tyra Banks here and say why.  The lighting is very good. The make up is done well. Not over or under done.  The hair is pleasing. The hat and outfit look wonderful on this model. The facial expression is spot on.  The only distraction I see is the thumb. It stands out a bit too much and I would have had her hold that down. Without that, this could go on any make up cover and outshine some of today''s top models. Very nicely done.', '2006-02-22 09:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170816, 298275, 15711, '<td valign="top">... as you should!!!!!</td>', '... as you should!!!!!', '2006-02-22 09:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170817, 298814, 50432, '<td valign="top">Funny, at the time I was voting, my hand was eactly in the same position as the mans hand is. lol</td>', 'Funny, at the time I was voting, my hand was eactly in the same position as the mans hand is. lol', '2006-02-22 09:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170822, 298715, 50432, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo!</td>', 'Very nice photo!', '2006-02-22 09:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170826, 298562, 47117, '<td valign="top">This isn''t exactly an ad selling photo for diamonds, but it is one of my top picks. Reason being the title and photo work very well together. The detail in the hands works well, and the diamond never changes as we do. I like the overall composition and concept of this a lot. Nicely thought out and nicely done. Not the best in technicals, but still enough for me to be pleased.</td>', 'This isn''t exactly an ad selling photo for diamonds, but it is one of my top picks. Reason being the title and photo work very well together. The detail in the hands works well, and the diamond never changes as we do. I like the overall composition and concept of this a lot. Nicely thought out and nicely done. Not the best in technicals, but still enough for me to be pleased.', '2006-02-22 09:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170827, 297445, 37879, '<td valign="top">Don''t ask me why...this is not really my style.  For me, this doesn''t shout fashion photography.  There is a bit of sensor dust along the top, the coat is blown out at the collar.  Wrinkles at the bottom fo the coat.  Bright line opening of light is a bit distracting at the bottom of the horizon...BUT  this is my favorite photo here.  This is why I love DPC.  Not a traditional "fashion" image...not what you see everytime you open a magazine.  Not a duplicated image.  This is something you created.  You''re making your own definitions.  The emotional power totally overplays the technical details (which could be fixed in advanced editing anyhow).  I''d love to know what you used for lighting since it appears you''re out in the middle of nowhere.  I love it!  10 from me. (sorry for the novel)</td>', 'Don''t ask me why...this is not really my style.  For me, this doesn''t shout fashion photography.  There is a bit of sensor dust along the top, the coat is blown out at the collar.  Wrinkles at the bottom fo the coat.  Bright line opening of light is a bit distracting at the bottom of the horizon...BUT  this is my favorite photo here.  This is why I love DPC.  Not a traditional "fashion" image...not what you see everytime you open a magazine.  Not a duplicated image.  This is something you created.  You''re making your own definitions.  The emotional power totally overplays the technical details (which could be fixed in advanced editing anyhow).  I''d love to know what you used for lighting since it appears you''re out in the middle of nowhere.  I love it!  10 from me. (sorry for the novel)', '2006-02-22 09:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170829, 298205, 50432, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great shot!  I don''t know what it has to do with ''fashion'' though.</td>', 'Wow!  Great shot!  I don''t know what it has to do with ''fashion'' though.', '2006-02-22 09:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170836, 298528, 50432, '<td valign="top">GOing for the Bogart look?  Good one! I don''t see waht it has to do with fashion though.</td>', 'GOing for the Bogart look?  Good one! I don''t see waht it has to do with fashion though.', '2006-02-22 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170841, 296650, 36606, '<td valign="top">can I get her number please? nice shot!</td>', 'can I get her number please? nice shot!', '2006-02-22 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170842, 297797, 50432, '<td valign="top">Very good photography, i think.  um, hmm.</td>', 'Very good photography, i think.  um, hmm.', '2006-02-22 09:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170850, 298082, 47117, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top voted photos. The background works very well here and the dof is a nice touch rather than a plain background. This is a shot that could have been taken by any pro photographer of fashion and placed on any magazine cover. I love the outfit, and if I could, this is just what I would wear *smile*.  I''m not thrilled with the hair. I think it could have been done better and more befitting to the outfit, but I like she is tipping the hat with her fingers and the other hand in the pocket. Attention to detail was well done by the director and/or model in that regard. The slight tilt in the photo is usually something I don''t like, but it works very well here.  Face/makeup of the model is clean and has a pleasing expression, but one with a bit more confidence showing through would have been better. However, all in all a very well done photo.</td>', 'This is one of my top voted photos. The background works very well here and the dof is a nice touch rather than a plain background. This is a shot that could have been taken by any pro photographer of fashion and placed on any magazine cover. I love the outfit, and if I could, this is just what I would wear *smile*.  I''m not thrilled with the hair. I think it could have been done better and more befitting to the outfit, but I like she is tipping the hat with her fingers and the other hand in the pocket. Attention to detail was well done by the director and/or model in that regard. The slight tilt in the photo is usually something I don''t like, but it works very well here.  Face/makeup of the model is clean and has a pleasing expression, but one with a bit more confidence showing through would have been better. However, all in all a very well done photo.', '2006-02-22 09:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170851, 298275, 50432, '<td valign="top">And, you are pretty, my dear.</td>', 'And, you are pretty, my dear.', '2006-02-22 09:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170860, 298584, 50432, '<td valign="top">Is this one about bondage?  Hmmm.</td>', 'Is this one about bondage?  Hmmm.', '2006-02-22 09:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170865, 298067, 50432, '<td valign="top">Great photography!</td>', 'Great photography!', '2006-02-22 09:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170872, 298562, 50432, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2006-02-22 09:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170877, 297065, 50432, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess!</td>', 'Well, I guess!', '2006-02-22 09:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170884, 298275, 32767, '<td valign="top">Holy Mother Of God...this is awesome. I would love to see this ribbon. Good Luck!</td>', 'Holy Mother Of God...this is awesome. I would love to see this ribbon. Good Luck!', '2006-02-22 09:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170886, 298095, 50432, '<td valign="top">You are obviously too sexy for your clothes, Barbie!</td>', 'You are obviously too sexy for your clothes, Barbie!', '2006-02-22 09:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170889, 297445, 47117, '<td valign="top">Everyone in this challenge that used a full live model took a risk. Here it was very well done. The coat itself I find rather bland, but in this background and setting, with expression of the model, I do find it pleasing. Something out of an old movie perhaps, and as if she is waiting for a plane to come in where she will meet up with her partner who maybe is another FBI agent. LOL....One of my top picks.</td>', 'Everyone in this challenge that used a full live model took a risk. Here it was very well done. The coat itself I find rather bland, but in this background and setting, with expression of the model, I do find it pleasing. Something out of an old movie perhaps, and as if she is waiting for a plane to come in where she will meet up with her partner who maybe is another FBI agent. LOL....One of my top picks.', '2006-02-22 09:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170893, 298492, 50432, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful person.  She has that Mona Lisa look about her.  Great photo!</td>', 'What a beautiful person.  She has that Mona Lisa look about her.  Great photo!', '2006-02-22 09:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170902, 298800, 50432, '<td valign="top">He is having an image crisis.</td>', 'He is having an image crisis.', '2006-02-22 09:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170904, 297120, 47117, '<td valign="top">To play a little bit of Tyra Banks here, this photo is well done. The only thing I find wrong is the model in this case is showing a bit too much neck, and too little face. Head forward and uplifted a bit would have been better. Also the left hand is doing something wierd.  The hair is great. The background works, but does have some kind of mark on it to the left of her left hip.  Too bad basic editing didn''t allow for that to be smudged out, but it''s not a huge distraction. This is in line with a few of my other top picks though. Well done.</td>', 'To play a little bit of Tyra Banks here, this photo is well done. The only thing I find wrong is the model in this case is showing a bit too much neck, and too little face. Head forward and uplifted a bit would have been better. Also the left hand is doing something wierd.  The hair is great. The background works, but does have some kind of mark on it to the left of her left hip.  Too bad basic editing didn''t allow for that to be smudged out, but it''s not a huge distraction. This is in line with a few of my other top picks though. Well done.', '2006-02-22 09:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
