(2170917, 298623, 47117, '<td valign="top">The only thing I find wrong with this is that it is a bit too dark. Other than that, the model is hot. The facial expression is spot on. It is very alluring and sexy, however little in fashion is shown. I see he is buttoning a suit, but the background doesn''t allow one to view the suit. But the hell with that, cause this guy is hot and looks like he is getting ready to leave from a wonderful and sexy filled evening. Considering his look, and the emotion of the shot, it is one of my top picks. I also suggest this guy look for real modeling work, if he hasn''t already. :)</td>', 'The only thing I find wrong with this is that it is a bit too dark. Other than that, the model is hot. The facial expression is spot on. It is very alluring and sexy, however little in fashion is shown. I see he is buttoning a suit, but the background doesn''t allow one to view the suit. But the hell with that, cause this guy is hot and looks like he is getting ready to leave from a wonderful and sexy filled evening. Considering his look, and the emotion of the shot, it is one of my top picks. I also suggest this guy look for real modeling work, if he hasn''t already. :)', '2006-02-22 09:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
