(2170977, 297422, 47117, '<td valign="top">Gosh. The dresses haven''t changed much from my era have they. LOL...Too bad that none of these girls picked a gown that fit them very well. They all look a bit frumpy other than the one sitting to the right in the green.  But I don''t like the halter tie to the neck. Very outdated in my opinion. Well, the photo shows fashion for sure, and I do like the setting and the capture.  I like that no one is really looking directly at the camera as well, and everyone is talking or doing something in the shot. So kudo''s and points for that!</td>', 'Gosh. The dresses haven''t changed much from my era have they. LOL...Too bad that none of these girls picked a gown that fit them very well. They all look a bit frumpy other than the one sitting to the right in the green.  But I don''t like the halter tie to the neck. Very outdated in my opinion. Well, the photo shows fashion for sure, and I do like the setting and the capture.  I like that no one is really looking directly at the camera as well, and everyone is talking or doing something in the shot. So kudo''s and points for that!', '2006-02-22 09:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171000, 298514, 47117, '<td valign="top">Everyone in this challenge who used a full and real model for this challenge took a huge risk, as models have to have a certain "look" in fashion photography.  In this photo I like that attention was paid to detail of where the hands were; little accessories not to cause distraction was a nice touch; the model is showing just enough neck in the right position and the shoulder isn''t hunched, which is nice; the earrings, although large, work well in this shot; and I guess my only critique would be the hair. I would have liked a different hair style here and one not so "safe", if you will.  The lips open just a tad is not a good thing in modeling though. Looks like she is trying to say something to the photographer through a smile.  The eyes show nice expression as well, but the make up to the eyes and brows is a bit severe.  A tad too dark.  However, all in all a very good photo for the challenge. Good work.</td>', 'Everyone in this challenge who used a full and real model for this challenge took a huge risk, as models have to have a certain "look" in fashion photography.  In this photo I like that attention was paid to detail of where the hands were; little accessories not to cause distraction was a nice touch; the model is showing just enough neck in the right position and the shoulder isn''t hunched, which is nice; the earrings, although large, work well in this shot; and I guess my only critique would be the hair. I would have liked a different hair style here and one not so "safe", if you will.  The lips open just a tad is not a good thing in modeling though. Looks like she is trying to say something to the photographer through a smile.  The eyes show nice expression as well, but the make up to the eyes and brows is a bit severe.  A tad too dark.  However, all in all a very good photo for the challenge. Good work.', '2006-02-22 10:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171020, 296915, 47117, '<td valign="top">This would make a very interesting ad in a magazine for spaghetti-strapped shoes. It shows creativity, and draws the attention to the design.  The title in this shows you were being humorous, but all in all and in high fashion this would actually make for a well done serious ad. I like this a lot. Good work.</td>', 'This would make a very interesting ad in a magazine for spaghetti-strapped shoes. It shows creativity, and draws the attention to the design.  The title in this shows you were being humorous, but all in all and in high fashion this would actually make for a well done serious ad. I like this a lot. Good work.', '2006-02-22 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171035, 297681, 33000, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this is not a photo that says "fashion". It''s rather a snapshot given a title that mentions fashion.</td>', 'I''m sorry but this is not a photo that says "fashion". It''s rather a snapshot given a title that mentions fashion.', '2006-02-22 10:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171039, 298732, 33000, '<td valign="top">Would be better if it was sharper and/or more in focus. The reddish hue is also not flattering.</td>', 'Would be better if it was sharper and/or more in focus. The reddish hue is also not flattering.', '2006-02-22 10:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171057, 298990, 47117, '<td valign="top">Whenever one uses a full real model in a fashion shoot, one has to be very careful to show both the fashion and the model in the proper way for the ad or fashion portrayed. Here is the good and bad with your risk:  The good is that the models expression is good, her hands are in a pleasing position, just enough neck is showing to pass the muster with modeling in this position, and the background for the shot is interesting - although I am not sure how it fits in with the fashion. However, I do like the warehouse usage. The bad is that the top does not fit her bossum properly and hides what would have been a very fashionable belt and waist line, the jewelry is too much of a distraction, and the bottom half of both legs are not properly lit in the shot. Too dark. All in all though, it is a good and what I would call a first-time amateur fashion photographer shot, and still got decent points from me. Nice work.</td>', 'Whenever one uses a full real model in a fashion shoot, one has to be very careful to show both the fashion and the model in the proper way for the ad or fashion portrayed. Here is the good and bad with your risk:  The good is that the models expression is good, her hands are in a pleasing position, just enough neck is showing to pass the muster with modeling in this position, and the background for the shot is interesting - although I am not sure how it fits in with the fashion. However, I do like the warehouse usage. The bad is that the top does not fit her bossum properly and hides what would have been a very fashionable belt and waist line, the jewelry is too much of a distraction, and the bottom half of both legs are not properly lit in the shot. Too dark. All in all though, it is a good and what I would call a first-time amateur fashion photographer shot, and still got decent points from me. Nice work.', '2006-02-22 10:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171061, 298826, 53626, '<td valign="top">very nice work.</td>', 'very nice work.', '2006-02-22 10:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
