(2171352, 298502, 47117, '<td valign="top">Love the tones. Love the espression. Love the attention to stance and hand placement. Love the face and the shadows under the eyes.  HATE the wrinkles in the outfit. Takes away from the almost sexy appeal of the photo. It is like he is saying "may I have this dance, madam" but being said by someone who wore the same clothes for the last month or by a slob...LOL.., which takes away from the allure that is being portrayed. Very distracting. BUT, nice change up from the rest of the entries, and a decent score given for that.</td>', 'Love the tones. Love the espression. Love the attention to stance and hand placement. Love the face and the shadows under the eyes.  HATE the wrinkles in the outfit. Takes away from the almost sexy appeal of the photo. It is like he is saying "may I have this dance, madam" but being said by someone who wore the same clothes for the last month or by a slob...LOL.., which takes away from the allure that is being portrayed. Very distracting. BUT, nice change up from the rest of the entries, and a decent score given for that.', '2006-02-22 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
