(2171382, 297136, 47117, '<td valign="top">The white awning is a distraction, but aside from that, very nicely done.  She could also lose the huge earrings, but I like the expression. It is like she is saying "Is that him?" as she looks around the corner. Waiting for her date or lover.  Nicely portrayed by a lovely model.  Very good balance, and one not easily portrayed using a full real model in a fashion shoot. Good work.</td>', 'The white awning is a distraction, but aside from that, very nicely done.  She could also lose the huge earrings, but I like the expression. It is like she is saying "Is that him?" as she looks around the corner. Waiting for her date or lover.  Nicely portrayed by a lovely model.  Very good balance, and one not easily portrayed using a full real model in a fashion shoot. Good work.', '2006-02-22 11:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
