(2171409, 298992, 35645, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Good shot, but not quite great. The light is a tad harsh (almost hot spots on the hand), the face and hand are just slightly out of focus, and the crop at the face is a little awkward (cutting the nose in pieces just isn''t appealing to me). However, I like the concept, and the pose.</td>', 'Hmmm. Good shot, but not quite great. The light is a tad harsh (almost hot spots on the hand), the face and hand are just slightly out of focus, and the crop at the face is a little awkward (cutting the nose in pieces just isn''t appealing to me). However, I like the concept, and the pose.', '2006-02-22 11:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
