(2171477, 298136, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  Perfect DOF and composition.  My only nitpik is that it seems a bit flat.  But overall, it fits the challenge nicely. 8</td>', 'This is very nice.  Perfect DOF and composition.  My only nitpik is that it seems a bit flat.  But overall, it fits the challenge nicely. 8', '2006-02-22 11:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
