(2171482, 298972, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, and I can see where this might be used as a cosmetics advertisement. The lighting seems a little harsh - or maybe a little cool. Warmer lighting might make her look a little younger and a little friendlier. Here she looks ''fierce'', which may or may not have been the intention.</td>', 'I like the pose, and I can see where this might be used as a cosmetics advertisement. The lighting seems a little harsh - or maybe a little cool. Warmer lighting might make her look a little younger and a little friendlier. Here she looks ''fierce'', which may or may not have been the intention.', '2006-02-22 11:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171490, 297445, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  LOve that she''s stading in the elements.  Adds a nice feel to the photo.  The lighting is nice, although maybe a smidge too bright on the face and shoulder. 9</td>', 'Beautiful!  LOve that she''s stading in the elements.  Adds a nice feel to the photo.  The lighting is nice, although maybe a smidge too bright on the face and shoulder. 9', '2006-02-22 11:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171497, 298681, 35645, '<td valign="top">The only, repeat only, thing that really detracts from this is that her reflection is in clearer focus than she is. I love the shot, love that it''s an ''action'' shot rather than a studio set-up, and I think it''s something that may well be seen in a fashion magazine. To me, though, the focus being entirely on the reflection detracts from the overall picture.</td>', 'The only, repeat only, thing that really detracts from this is that her reflection is in clearer focus than she is. I love the shot, love that it''s an ''action'' shot rather than a studio set-up, and I think it''s something that may well be seen in a fashion magazine. To me, though, the focus being entirely on the reflection detracts from the overall picture.', '2006-02-22 11:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171510, 298729, 48435, '<td valign="top">After I flew over NO one night last month and saw the amount of the city that was STILL covereed in darkness, I somehow have a hard time being objective about this image.  I feel it is supposed to be a tongue-in-cheek sort of image,  but it would be like giving water wings to the Tsunami survivors.  Sorry for the rant. <br/> <br/>On a technical note, the background is too close and it is too washed.  The shadows that are cast seem fake, but that is just an element of contrast reducing the shadow gradient threshold.</td>', 'After I flew over NO one night last month and saw the amount of the city that was STILL covereed in darkness, I somehow have a hard time being objective about this image.  I feel it is supposed to be a tongue-in-cheek sort of image,  but it would be like giving water wings to the Tsunami survivors.  Sorry for the rant.  On a technical note, the background is too close and it is too washed.  The shadows that are cast seem fake, but that is just an element of contrast reducing the shadow gradient threshold.', '2006-02-22 11:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171511, 298200, 51767, '<td valign="top">Really nice photograph - wanted the head to finish the fashion statement.</td>', 'Really nice photograph - wanted the head to finish the fashion statement.', '2006-02-22 11:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171539, 298996, 51767, '<td valign="top">Its all in the shirt</td>', 'Its all in the shirt', '2006-02-22 11:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171555, 298205, 32133, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the lighting is good.  I think a prettier bottle would have made this good picture a great picture.</td>', 'I like the concept and the lighting is good.  I think a prettier bottle would have made this good picture a great picture.', '2006-02-22 11:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171556, 298754, 35645, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I feel like her face should be what''s in focus, not her hand and rear-end. Also, the light seems to miss her face, so she''s kind of left in the dark. The pose isn''t very flattering to her body shape, and the color seems to wash her out a bit.<br/>I like the idea behind it, though. I feel like with a few adjustments and a lighter colored wardrobe this could easily be found in the pages of a fashion magazine.</td>', 'Hmmm... I feel like her face should be what''s in focus, not her hand and rear-end. Also, the light seems to miss her face, so she''s kind of left in the dark. The pose isn''t very flattering to her body shape, and the color seems to wash her out a bit.I like the idea behind it, though. I feel like with a few adjustments and a lighter colored wardrobe this could easily be found in the pages of a fashion magazine.', '2006-02-22 11:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171570, 298293, 35645, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if it''s the lighting or her makeup, but her face is very yellow. I think it''s the makeup, since her forearm isn''t as yellow. The pose is ok, except for the placement of her hand - it would be far more flattering to have the back of her hand along the other side of her face. As it is now, it makes her hand and her jaw look overly large.</td>', 'Don''t know if it''s the lighting or her makeup, but her face is very yellow. I think it''s the makeup, since her forearm isn''t as yellow. The pose is ok, except for the placement of her hand - it would be far more flattering to have the back of her hand along the other side of her face. As it is now, it makes her hand and her jaw look overly large.', '2006-02-22 11:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171574, 298562, 51767, '<td valign="top">Great idea - needed more precise lighting to highlight the stone.</td>', 'Great idea - needed more precise lighting to highlight the stone.', '2006-02-22 11:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
