(2171609, 297422, 48435, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting them all to pose.  The flash lighting highlights the table more than the people, perhaps cropping off the bottom third of the image.  Also  cropping closer on the sides might make it seem like the party is extendng off the frame.</td>', 'Nice job getting them all to pose.  The flash lighting highlights the table more than the people, perhaps cropping off the bottom third of the image.  Also  cropping closer on the sides might make it seem like the party is extendng off the frame.', '2006-02-22 11:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
