(2171614, 297790, 35645, '<td valign="top">The only thing that throws this off for me is the tightness of the crop on the left side. I would like to see at least the edge of her hairline on the other side of her face to give it a little more definition. As it stands, she seems a little ''lop-sided'' with no defining edge on the left. Also, perhaps a little more skin texture would be nice - she has a little bit of a plastic look to her. ''The Look'', however, was captured perfectly.</td>', 'The only thing that throws this off for me is the tightness of the crop on the left side. I would like to see at least the edge of her hairline on the other side of her face to give it a little more definition. As it stands, she seems a little ''lop-sided'' with no defining edge on the left. Also, perhaps a little more skin texture would be nice - she has a little bit of a plastic look to her. ''The Look'', however, was captured perfectly.', '2006-02-22 11:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
