(2171683, 298082, 35645, '<td valign="top">Had you waited a second or two more and shot this without the people in the background, this would have scored much higher with me. Love the concept, love the rich colors, and I love her ''attitude''. Not too sure about the tilt, but since I can see that it was intentional, I''ll not mark it down simply because it doesn''t really appeal to me. The onlookers in the background, though, are a major distraction.</td>', 'Had you waited a second or two more and shot this without the people in the background, this would have scored much higher with me. Love the concept, love the rich colors, and I love her ''attitude''. Not too sure about the tilt, but since I can see that it was intentional, I''ll not mark it down simply because it doesn''t really appeal to me. The onlookers in the background, though, are a major distraction.', '2006-02-22 11:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171691, 298514, 35645, '<td valign="top">Classic ''model'' pose, beautiful skin tones, nice concept. Maybe add a hair light to separate her hair from the background a little more. Otherwise the lighting is really nice.</td>', 'Classic ''model'' pose, beautiful skin tones, nice concept. Maybe add a hair light to separate her hair from the background a little more. Otherwise the lighting is really nice.', '2006-02-22 11:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
