(2171696, 297280, 52292, '<td valign="top">Looks like theatre and i like theatre ;) Nice shot</td>', 'Looks like theatre and i like theatre ;) Nice shot', '2006-02-22 11:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171700, 297135, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like this pose for this subject - seems too ''adult'' to me. Also, the black boots get lost in the flooring. Bringing the lighter background down onto the floor and then up behind the subject would cure that. Love the outfit and the ''attitude'', though, and aside from the pose (and wrinkled background) I could envision this in a children''s fashion spread.</td>', 'Not sure I like this pose for this subject - seems too ''adult'' to me. Also, the black boots get lost in the flooring. Bringing the lighter background down onto the floor and then up behind the subject would cure that. Love the outfit and the ''attitude'', though, and aside from the pose (and wrinkled background) I could envision this in a children''s fashion spread.', '2006-02-22 11:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171701, 298832, 51767, '<td valign="top">Needed a little more of the model - the shoes finish the look?  The hat is drawing me there...</td>', 'Needed a little more of the model - the shoes finish the look?  The hat is drawing me there...', '2006-02-22 11:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
