(2171759, 296491, 35645, '<td valign="top">Nice. Perhaps a bit too soft, but that''s just personal preference. Crop is maybe a little tight on the left, but other than that, this is a really good fashion photo.</td>', 'Nice. Perhaps a bit too soft, but that''s just personal preference. Crop is maybe a little tight on the left, but other than that, this is a really good fashion photo.', '2006-02-22 12:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171768, 298715, 35645, '<td valign="top">The only negatives I have for this are the column growing from her shoulder and through her head, and the lady in the background. Otherwise this is really nice.</td>', 'The only negatives I have for this are the column growing from her shoulder and through her head, and the lady in the background. Otherwise this is really nice.', '2006-02-22 12:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171779, 298470, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very late-1950''s-Vogue. Love it.</td>', 'Very nice, very late-1950''s-Vogue. Love it.', '2006-02-22 12:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171783, 298535, 35645, '<td valign="top">She blends very well into the background. A lighter or brighter color for the background and this would be a great image instead of a ''good'' image.</td>', 'She blends very well into the background. A lighter or brighter color for the background and this would be a great image instead of a ''good'' image.', '2006-02-22 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171806, 297104, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is kind of bizarre to me. Without the cat, it''s an ok image - the pose feels a little forced, the light is a trifle harsh, and the crop is a little tight on the left, but it''s ok. Having the cat in there is just very distracting - it''s unnecessary, and it''s not in a flattering or ''accessorizing'' place. Had she been holding the cat, or petting the cat, or even shooing him off the set, I would have been ok with it. As it is, (and I know this isn''t a professional shoot) it gives the appearance of not being able to control the conditions you''re photographing in. (And I am aware that cats are a law unto themselves.) I also think (call me a prude if you wish) that having the cat peeping out from under her skirt is going to result in a lot of off color and inappropriate jokes (not that I expect any of them will make it into your comments, but they will be made). Not something you necessarily want or indeed that you probably even thought about. Just my two cents, but it is something you may wish to consider in later shoots.</td>', 'This is kind of bizarre to me. Without the cat, it''s an ok image - the pose feels a little forced, the light is a trifle harsh, and the crop is a little tight on the left, but it''s ok. Having the cat in there is just very distracting - it''s unnecessary, and it''s not in a flattering or ''accessorizing'' place. Had she been holding the cat, or petting the cat, or even shooing him off the set, I would have been ok with it. As it is, (and I know this isn''t a professional shoot) it gives the appearance of not being able to control the conditions you''re photographing in. (And I am aware that cats are a law unto themselves.) I also think (call me a prude if you wish) that having the cat peeping out from under her skirt is going to result in a lot of off color and inappropriate jokes (not that I expect any of them will make it into your comments, but they will be made). Not something you necessarily want or indeed that you probably even thought about. Just my two cents, but it is something you may wish to consider in later shoots.', '2006-02-22 12:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171815, 297597, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the surroundings, and the concept of the photo fits neatly into the concept of fasion photography. The lighting, however, (or maybe it''s the post-processing) gives his skin a blue cast, which makes him look like he''s absolutely freezing. Not a look that most fashion editors would go for. Other than that, t''s a very good shot.</td>', 'I like the pose and the surroundings, and the concept of the photo fits neatly into the concept of fasion photography. The lighting, however, (or maybe it''s the post-processing) gives his skin a blue cast, which makes him look like he''s absolutely freezing. Not a look that most fashion editors would go for. Other than that, t''s a very good shot.', '2006-02-22 12:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171820, 297065, 35645, '<td valign="top">Other than her pose looking a little forced, I like this. Having one leg bent under like that just isn''t flattering, and it looks uncomfortable.</td>', 'Other than her pose looking a little forced, I like this. Having one leg bent under like that just isn''t flattering, and it looks uncomfortable.', '2006-02-22 12:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171831, 296104, 37215, '<td valign="top">Dislike the effect on the face and do not feel it fits the challenge (Sorry!) I admire you for trying something different.</td>', 'Dislike the effect on the face and do not feel it fits the challenge (Sorry!) I admire you for trying something different.', '2006-02-22 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171834, 297779, 37215, '<td valign="top">Likr this very much. Pity about the reflection glare on him</td>', 'Likr this very much. Pity about the reflection glare on him', '2006-02-22 12:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171840, 297364, 37215, '<td valign="top">Looks like a young Kathleen Turner! Lovely shot</td>', 'Looks like a young Kathleen Turner! Lovely shot', '2006-02-22 12:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171846, 298715, 37215, '<td valign="top">IMO needed cropping higher or lower. The train of  a wedding dress is very important or just show the bouquet and top third. Good sharp shot, not sure about angle</td>', 'IMO needed cropping higher or lower. The train of  a wedding dress is very important or just show the bouquet and top third. Good sharp shot, not sure about angle', '2006-02-22 12:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171849, 298441, 37215, '<td valign="top">vibrant shot well done! great model</td>', 'vibrant shot well done! great model', '2006-02-22 12:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2171856, 297975, 43437, '<td valign="top">I second that! Great outfit, lighting, and fashionable pose.  Your hands look a little red but that may be my monitor.  I like the socks :)</td>', 'I second that! Great outfit, lighting, and fashionable pose.  Your hands look a little red but that may be my monitor.  I like the socks :)', '2006-02-22 12:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
