(2172086, 298682, 51767, '<td valign="top">Backdrop a distraction (steam or wash or scrunch).  Not sure why feet and top of head are gone - how does that make "Fashion" image better?  In a shot like this you should have control of everything.</td>', 'Backdrop a distraction (steam or wash or scrunch).  Not sure why feet and top of head are gone - how does that make "Fashion" image better?  In a shot like this you should have control of everything.', '2006-02-22 13:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
