(2172518, 296491, 34217, '<td valign="top">It is rare to find soft focus in fashion. I would normally be willing to look past it, but the soft focus is so over done in this shot that it is hard to.  It should be a little more subtle if you ask me.  However, your lighting is just wonderful.  I think this is a little more on the portait side than the fashion side.</td>', 'It is rare to find soft focus in fashion. I would normally be willing to look past it, but the soft focus is so over done in this shot that it is hard to.  It should be a little more subtle if you ask me.  However, your lighting is just wonderful.  I think this is a little more on the portait side than the fashion side.', '2006-02-22 15:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172524, 296988, 35645, '<td valign="top">Background is a little distracting. Shadows are very harsh - perhaps a fill light or reflector to lighten them up a bit. The pose is kind of blah - it says to me ''take the picture already'' instead of ''look at me - I''m  a fashion model!''. The colors are good, and the skin tones are nice - not too much yellow or red and not washed out. Mostly, I think the problem with this is that it''s too ''busy'' - a simpler background would do wonders for this as far as ''punching up the imapct value'' goes.</td>', 'Background is a little distracting. Shadows are very harsh - perhaps a fill light or reflector to lighten them up a bit. The pose is kind of blah - it says to me ''take the picture already'' instead of ''look at me - I''m  a fashion model!''. The colors are good, and the skin tones are nice - not too much yellow or red and not washed out. Mostly, I think the problem with this is that it''s too ''busy'' - a simpler background would do wonders for this as far as ''punching up the imapct value'' goes.', '2006-02-22 15:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172527, 298502, 34217, '<td valign="top">I have one word for you... Iron!<br/>Ok maybe I have a few more.  I do like the threads you picked out, but next time please please please take the time to iron then, it will make a HUGE difference in how professional you work looks.</td>', 'I have one word for you... Iron!Ok maybe I have a few more.  I do like the threads you picked out, but next time please please please take the time to iron then, it will make a HUGE difference in how professional you work looks.', '2006-02-22 15:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
