(2172540, 296160, 35645, '<td valign="top">OK. It''s a street shot. The fellow on the right is closest, so it seems as though he should be the subject, but he is out of focus (as is the rest of the photo). Two other points: I don''t get the connection between ''dressed for the cold'' and ''suspicious'', and the lighting certainly does nothing to indicate that anyone in the photo is, or should be, suspicious of anything. Sorry, but I just don''t see the connection between the title and the photo, or the photo and the challenge.</td>', 'OK. It''s a street shot. The fellow on the right is closest, so it seems as though he should be the subject, but he is out of focus (as is the rest of the photo). Two other points: I don''t get the connection between ''dressed for the cold'' and ''suspicious'', and the lighting certainly does nothing to indicate that anyone in the photo is, or should be, suspicious of anything. Sorry, but I just don''t see the connection between the title and the photo, or the photo and the challenge.', '2006-02-22 15:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172550, 298683, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for a high contrast shot. Fits the challenge topic quite well. Crop is a little tight on the left. Details are crisp and clean.</td>', 'Interesting choice for a high contrast shot. Fits the challenge topic quite well. Crop is a little tight on the left. Details are crisp and clean.', '2006-02-22 15:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172555, 297061, 34217, '<td valign="top">The angle you took the photo at makes you model look like she has fat legs.  Try not to shoot with legs or hip in foreground if you are photographing any one larger than a size 1.  I will make you models feel better</td>', 'The angle you took the photo at makes you model look like she has fat legs.  Try not to shoot with legs or hip in foreground if you are photographing any one larger than a size 1.  I will make you models feel better', '2006-02-22 15:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172565, 298275, 35645, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more it looks like it was taken backstage at a drag show. Which of course just screams ''Fashion!'' to me. :) Have to say that the lighting on this is great, and the blue eyeshadow really brings out the blue in your eyes. The title is just perfect for the shot.<br/>(Oh, and by the way, this has been critiqued as "That''s just silly!" by a six-year-old photography critic. Higher praise you cannot get!)</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more it looks like it was taken backstage at a drag show. Which of course just screams ''Fashion!'' to me. :) Have to say that the lighting on this is great, and the blue eyeshadow really brings out the blue in your eyes. The title is just perfect for the shot.(Oh, and by the way, this has been critiqued as "That''s just silly!" by a six-year-old photography critic. Higher praise you cannot get!)', '2006-02-22 15:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172572, 298095, 34217, '<td valign="top">Its a good thing babies don''t have nipples of she would be hanging out out her dress!!!</td>', 'Its a good thing babies don''t have nipples of she would be hanging out out her dress!!!', '2006-02-22 15:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
