(2172592, 298441, 35645, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, beautiful model, good lighting, good separation from the background, excellent skin tones, love the smile, love the fact that she''s not trying to do the ''look down your nose at all the little people'' expression or the ''look at me I''m the most gorgeous thing in the room'' sneer.<br/>What I don''t particularly care for is the placement of her hands. Both hands tugging down on the dress, or both slightly pulling up on the dress (slip?) would have worked better for me. As it stands, the hands throw off the vibe of the pic.If you were to crop the pic just at the hips (even though it''s be slightly awkward with _no_ hands), what you get is a very relaxed, casual, ''I''m having fun'' feel to the photo. As it''s cropped now, with the hands as they are, it''s more of a ''this is kinda fun, but I''m a little uncomfortable, and what do I do with my hands'' sort of feel.</td>', 'Love the idea, beautiful model, good lighting, good separation from the background, excellent skin tones, love the smile, love the fact that she''s not trying to do the ''look down your nose at all the little people'' expression or the ''look at me I''m the most gorgeous thing in the room'' sneer.What I don''t particularly care for is the placement of her hands. Both hands tugging down on the dress, or both slightly pulling up on the dress (slip?) would have worked better for me. As it stands, the hands throw off the vibe of the pic.If you were to crop the pic just at the hips (even though it''s be slightly awkward with _no_ hands), what you get is a very relaxed, casual, ''I''m having fun'' feel to the photo. As it''s cropped now, with the hands as they are, it''s more of a ''this is kinda fun, but I''m a little uncomfortable, and what do I do with my hands'' sort of feel.', '2006-02-22 15:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172602, 298623, 35645, '<td valign="top">The only thing I don''t like about this is that there is no separation from the background. All the black blends together, and there are no details in the black to suggest where he leaves off and the background begins, so that what we are left with is a (very sexy) floating head and pair of hands.</td>', 'The only thing I don''t like about this is that there is no separation from the background. All the black blends together, and there are no details in the black to suggest where he leaves off and the background begins, so that what we are left with is a (very sexy) floating head and pair of hands.', '2006-02-22 15:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172610, 296612, 29770, '<td valign="top">Fashion?</td>', 'Fashion?', '2006-02-22 15:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
