(2172620, 297364, 35645, '<td valign="top">Would have been better for me had she been holding the glasses in her hand (or possibly with one of the ear-pieces in her teeth) rather than wearing them. There''s a lot of glare from the lighting across the top and lenses of the glasses.<br/>Also, have a care for the background - the light colored bit at the top right is distracting.<br/>I like the softer focus, and the pose is ok (except for the note about the glasses). I like that you''ve been able to preserve her skin tones and hair-color well (not always easy to do with redheads).</td>', 'Would have been better for me had she been holding the glasses in her hand (or possibly with one of the ear-pieces in her teeth) rather than wearing them. There''s a lot of glare from the lighting across the top and lenses of the glasses.Also, have a care for the background - the light colored bit at the top right is distracting.I like the softer focus, and the pose is ok (except for the note about the glasses). I like that you''ve been able to preserve her skin tones and hair-color well (not always easy to do with redheads).', '2006-02-22 15:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172623, 297797, 1707, '<td valign="top">good concept and love the tattoos - could really be used for an advertisement.  Excellent job! Lower left is lighted out, would be it''s best if the entire photo was in the same light</td>', 'good concept and love the tattoos - could really be used for an advertisement.  Excellent job! Lower left is lighted out, would be it''s best if the entire photo was in the same light', '2006-02-22 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
