(2172632, 297445, 35645, '<td valign="top">Now this is very nice, very sophisticated, very ''fashion magazine'' to me. The lighting  and pose are perfect for this shot. Use of a natural (and very pretty) background is a huge boost for this photo - it would have looked good as a studio shot; it''s great as it is. Very well done. 10.</td>', 'Now this is very nice, very sophisticated, very ''fashion magazine'' to me. The lighting  and pose are perfect for this shot. Use of a natural (and very pretty) background is a huge boost for this photo - it would have looked good as a studio shot; it''s great as it is. Very well done. 10.', '2006-02-22 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
