(2172684, 297975, 35645, '<td valign="top">Even with all the colors on, the model is blending into the background. A lighter or more neutral colored background would have worked better to ''bring out'' the model and separate her from the background.</td>', 'Even with all the colors on, the model is blending into the background. A lighter or more neutral colored background would have worked better to ''bring out'' the model and separate her from the background.', '2006-02-22 15:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172687, 297597, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  The background texture adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice job.  The background texture adds a nice touch.', '2006-02-22 15:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172690, 298951, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Could easily be in a catalog or magazine.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Could easily be in a catalog or magazine.', '2006-02-22 15:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172692, 298623, 29770, '<td valign="top">The only thing missing is some distinction between the background and the model.  Otherwise a good looking shot.</td>', 'The only thing missing is some distinction between the background and the model.  Otherwise a good looking shot.', '2006-02-22 15:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172696, 297079, 1707, '<td valign="top">I see your point - black and white and gray in the middle...</td>', 'I see your point - black and white and gray in the middle...', '2006-02-22 15:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172697, 297445, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice looking shot.  The hard lighting on your subject against the fading sky works well.</td>', 'Nice looking shot.  The hard lighting on your subject against the fading sky works well.', '2006-02-22 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172706, 297065, 29770, '<td valign="top">That is some interesting fashion.  Can''t say that I have seen anything like that walking around.  Nice shot with the different colors.  The models skin tone and the color of the "dress" works very well against the black leather.  Nice Job.</td>', 'That is some interesting fashion.  Can''t say that I have seen anything like that walking around.  Nice shot with the different colors.  The models skin tone and the color of the "dress" works very well against the black leather.  Nice Job.', '2006-02-22 15:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172711, 297280, 35645, '<td valign="top">Well, she may stand out in the crowd, but here the top of her head''s chopped off. Not to be rude, but this looks like it could be a rejected picture from a series of backstage and performance shots that was rescued from the recycle bin by being shoehorned into the challenge. <br/>This picture could have looked at least _intentional_ by not chopping her head off and by giving this a vertical rather than horizontal treatment. The way it stands now, frankly, it looks like you bumped the tripod head down and to the right and didn''t notice until you already had the shot.<br/>I like the concept of it, and it''s definately taken in unique (at least for this challenge) surroundings, but I feel as though it could have been executed much better.</td>', 'Well, she may stand out in the crowd, but here the top of her head''s chopped off. Not to be rude, but this looks like it could be a rejected picture from a series of backstage and performance shots that was rescued from the recycle bin by being shoehorned into the challenge. This picture could have looked at least _intentional_ by not chopping her head off and by giving this a vertical rather than horizontal treatment. The way it stands now, frankly, it looks like you bumped the tripod head down and to the right and didn''t notice until you already had the shot.I like the concept of it, and it''s definately taken in unique (at least for this challenge) surroundings, but I feel as though it could have been executed much better.', '2006-02-22 15:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172712, 298827, 1707, '<td valign="top">an adorable baby but too much flash - try sitting baby next to window with natural daylight and turn off your flash! Also if you are advertising Carter, it''s better to see the front chest</td>', 'an adorable baby but too much flash - try sitting baby next to window with natural daylight and turn off your flash! Also if you are advertising Carter, it''s better to see the front chest', '2006-02-22 15:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172713, 298293, 29770, '<td valign="top">A little "Victoria''s Secret" fasion.  I like it.<br/> <br/>I like the setup agains the black background.  The only thing that bothers me is the diffence of skin color between the hand and face.  I can''t tell if it''s just the lighting of the makeup.  Just my $.02. <br/> <br/>Otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'A little "Victoria''s Secret" fasion.  I like it. I like the setup agains the black background.  The only thing that bothers me is the diffence of skin color between the hand and face.  I can''t tell if it''s just the lighting of the makeup.  Just my $.02.  Otherwise a great shot.', '2006-02-22 15:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172714, 298441, 29770, '<td valign="top">Very fun and playful.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Very fun and playful.  Nice shot.', '2006-02-22 15:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172717, 298682, 35645, '<td valign="top">The models is nice, subject placement is good, pose is good, lighting is good. However, this being a basic challenge where you knew you could not do spot editing, you could have taken 5 minutes and ironed the sheet. Or at least draped it to minimize or hide unintentional creases. Also, the crop is just a wee bit close at the top of the pic. About another quarter or half-inch of photo would have felt more natural. Because of the creases and the crop, this gets a 6 rather than an 8.</td>', 'The models is nice, subject placement is good, pose is good, lighting is good. However, this being a basic challenge where you knew you could not do spot editing, you could have taken 5 minutes and ironed the sheet. Or at least draped it to minimize or hide unintentional creases. Also, the crop is just a wee bit close at the top of the pic. About another quarter or half-inch of photo would have felt more natural. Because of the creases and the crop, this gets a 6 rather than an 8.', '2006-02-22 15:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172720, 298537, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Your model is very relaxed which makes this look very natural.  The colors work well.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Your model is very relaxed which makes this look very natural.  The colors work well.', '2006-02-22 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2172724, 296915, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I like to see an unusual concept executed well, and this does that to perfection. Love it.</td>', 'Very nice! I like to see an unusual concept executed well, and this does that to perfection. Love it.', '2006-02-22 15:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
