(2173232, 298537, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great balance of colors and tones. The presentation at an angle works well.<br/> <br/>I hope that the border doesn''t disqualify this for basic editing. That would be a shame, I hope I''m wrong. (to be clear: I have not recommended this for disqualifiction)</td>', 'Great balance of colors and tones. The presentation at an angle works well. I hope that the border doesn''t disqualify this for basic editing. That would be a shame, I hope I''m wrong. (to be clear: I have not recommended this for disqualifiction)', '2006-02-22 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
