(2173838, 296600, 35645, '<td valign="top">This photo fails for me for several reasons. Firstly, the image is small and appears to have some pixelation problems. While I can see that the end of the slide is ''level'', the horizon is very obviously (judging from the lines of the house (or fence) in the background) tilted. Also, while this could possibly meet the definition of an attept at an action shot, I do not feel that this in any way meets the challenge according to the challenge definition or title.</td>', 'This photo fails for me for several reasons. Firstly, the image is small and appears to have some pixelation problems. While I can see that the end of the slide is ''level'', the horizon is very obviously (judging from the lines of the house (or fence) in the background) tilted. Also, while this could possibly meet the definition of an attept at an action shot, I do not feel that this in any way meets the challenge according to the challenge definition or title.', '2006-02-22 20:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
