(2173907, 298842, 35645, '<td valign="top">I have to be brutally honest here. This looks like a shot you''d get back on a roll of film from a camera that was passed around at a frat party after all the girls had left and the beer was gone and there wasn''t anything else to do. The lighting is harsh, the composition just does not work, and the focus seems off.</td>', 'I have to be brutally honest here. This looks like a shot you''d get back on a roll of film from a camera that was passed around at a frat party after all the girls had left and the beer was gone and there wasn''t anything else to do. The lighting is harsh, the composition just does not work, and the focus seems off.', '2006-02-22 20:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2173914, 298951, 35645, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, nice color. The pose is good till you get to the face. I would rather see him looking slightly toward the floor and smiling, or looking straight at the camera with a ''I''m sexy and I know it'' look. The quizzical look he has on his face just kind of mucks up the ''feel'' of this as a ''fashion photo''.</td>', 'Good lighting, nice color. The pose is good till you get to the face. I would rather see him looking slightly toward the floor and smiling, or looking straight at the camera with a ''I''m sexy and I know it'' look. The quizzical look he has on his face just kind of mucks up the ''feel'' of this as a ''fashion photo''.', '2006-02-22 20:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
