(2174316, 298535, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think I remember this young lady from another well prepared image in another challenge some time ago.  Very attractive...hard to forget.  ;^)  I like the approach you''ve taken with the fasion piece - very trendy, nice pose by the model, great attention to the details (lighting, exposure, focus, etc...).  Some nitpicking to do on the hair showing under her left hand.  This leads to the fuzzies (?) on her visible gloved hand.  Minor, I know.<br/> <br/>This shot would be a fine image for publication.  Well done.</td>', 'I think I remember this young lady from another well prepared image in another challenge some time ago.  Very attractive...hard to forget.  ;^)  I like the approach you''ve taken with the fasion piece - very trendy, nice pose by the model, great attention to the details (lighting, exposure, focus, etc...).  Some nitpicking to do on the hair showing under her left hand.  This leads to the fuzzies (?) on her visible gloved hand.  Minor, I know. This shot would be a fine image for publication.  Well done.', '2006-02-22 22:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
