(2174346, 296160, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The guy in the background (white shirt and dark jacket with sunglasses) looking at the camera makes me wonder about the setup.  Is the primary subject (brown jacket, hat, and glasses) the photographer?  Is there a tripod setup on the sidewalk?  Maybe the subject is a stranger?  So many questions!  That''s a good thing in a way...makes people think.<br/> <br/>Technically the image is "OK".  Primary subject doesn''t appear as sharp/focused as I would like to see.  I wonder about the ISO also as there seems to be some noise.<br/> <br/>Interesting approach to the challenge. 6 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting image.  The guy in the background (white shirt and dark jacket with sunglasses) looking at the camera makes me wonder about the setup.  Is the primary subject (brown jacket, hat, and glasses) the photographer?  Is there a tripod setup on the sidewalk?  Maybe the subject is a stranger?  So many questions!  That''s a good thing in a way...makes people think. Technically the image is "OK".  Primary subject doesn''t appear as sharp/focused as I would like to see.  I wonder about the ISO also as there seems to be some noise. Interesting approach to the challenge. 6 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-22 22:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
