(2174599, 297643, 45672, '<td valign="top">Well, she is certainly a beautiful model, I just think you could have done a little better metering the light.  If her face was a little sharper it would help too.  The wall is grey, so I think if you used a grey card here and metered off the card, you would have been able to get the wall to whiten up and this adding more contrast in the picture.  The thing she''s holding above her head is a little unidentifiable, so it might be taking away from the shot.  I think if it were just her arms over her head it would be a far better shot.  Anyway, nice attempt and try a little better light metering and lighting next time and a little more sharpness and I think you''ll nail it.  Nice going.</td>', 'Well, she is certainly a beautiful model, I just think you could have done a little better metering the light.  If her face was a little sharper it would help too.  The wall is grey, so I think if you used a grey card here and metered off the card, you would have been able to get the wall to whiten up and this adding more contrast in the picture.  The thing she''s holding above her head is a little unidentifiable, so it might be taking away from the shot.  I think if it were just her arms over her head it would be a far better shot.  Anyway, nice attempt and try a little better light metering and lighting next time and a little more sharpness and I think you''ll nail it.  Nice going.', '2006-02-23 00:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
