(2177500, 296612, 41675, '<td valign="top">Uhm, I really hope you entered this as a joke. For me, it doesn''t even come close to fashion and the quality is very pixelated.</td>', 'Uhm, I really hope you entered this as a joke. For me, it doesn''t even come close to fashion and the quality is very pixelated.', '2006-02-23 21:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177506, 296600, 41675, '<td valign="top">Fashion? Hmmm, perhaps. If the overall image size were larger - closer to the maximum 640 pixels allowed, I think it would give the voters a better look.</td>', 'Fashion? Hmmm, perhaps. If the overall image size were larger - closer to the maximum 640 pixels allowed, I think it would give the voters a better look.', '2006-02-23 21:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177507, 298732, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think you have a decent concept and notion. For me, the lighting is a bit too yellow and overall it would be even better if more in focus.</td>', 'I think you have a decent concept and notion. For me, the lighting is a bit too yellow and overall it would be even better if more in focus.', '2006-02-23 21:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177514, 296498, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The thing that keeps drawing my attention is how the lamplight seems to be protruding from the cat''s cheek - looks kind of odd. Perhaps if the background were blurred out to keep the ofcus on the man and cat only, it would help. Just my unprofessional observations.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The thing that keeps drawing my attention is how the lamplight seems to be protruding from the cat''s cheek - looks kind of odd. Perhaps if the background were blurred out to keep the ofcus on the man and cat only, it would help. Just my unprofessional observations.', '2006-02-23 21:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177520, 298619, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I wish there were less wrinkles in the material the faces were printed on. Also, if your overall shot was larger, closer to the allowable 640 pixels, it might have better impact, or at least allow is with aging eyes to see everything better. :-)</td>', 'Interesting image. I wish there were less wrinkles in the material the faces were printed on. Also, if your overall shot was larger, closer to the allowable 640 pixels, it might have better impact, or at least allow is with aging eyes to see everything better. :-)', '2006-02-23 21:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177522, 297823, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting is a bit too harsh and on the yellow side. I''m curious how this would look if you had lined the shoes up perpendicular with the lines of the flooring.</td>', 'For me, the lighting is a bit too harsh and on the yellow side. I''m curious how this would look if you had lined the shoes up perpendicular with the lines of the flooring.', '2006-02-23 21:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177524, 298834, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your notion of lighting the bottle the way you did. For me, technically, I think if you pulled the camera back a bit and it had better clarity, I would like it better. Just my untrained observations.</td>', 'I like your notion of lighting the bottle the way you did. For me, technically, I think if you pulled the camera back a bit and it had better clarity, I would like it better. Just my untrained observations.', '2006-02-23 21:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177527, 298919, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice picture of your daughter? Very busy with all the kids. I find the instructor on the right distracting. I wonder how this would have looked if you were able to get closer and focus in on just a few of the gymnasts.</td>', 'A nice picture of your daughter? Very busy with all the kids. I find the instructor on the right distracting. I wonder how this would have looked if you were able to get closer and focus in on just a few of the gymnasts.', '2006-02-23 21:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177529, 296160, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute title. For me it aids your image. Although I think the man in the front is your focal point, it''s the mane in the dark jacket and shades that my eyes keep getting drawn to.</td>', 'Cute title. For me it aids your image. Although I think the man in the front is your focal point, it''s the mane in the dark jacket and shades that my eyes keep getting drawn to.', '2006-02-23 21:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177532, 298842, 41675, '<td valign="top">After looking at your image for a few minutes now, I sometimes feel like I am looking at two separate images (even though I know I''m not). I think it''s the light of the face "fighting" with the darkness of the hair. not sure if that makes sense to you, but that''s how I view your photo.</td>', 'After looking at your image for a few minutes now, I sometimes feel like I am looking at two separate images (even though I know I''m not). I think it''s the light of the face "fighting" with the darkness of the hair. not sure if that makes sense to you, but that''s how I view your photo.', '2006-02-23 22:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177536, 298924, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the natural lighting. Compared with others in the challenge, it doesn''t hold my interest as well, but I did feel pride for those serving when I first viewed your photo.</td>', 'I like the natural lighting. Compared with others in the challenge, it doesn''t hold my interest as well, but I did feel pride for those serving when I first viewed your photo.', '2006-02-23 22:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177542, 298684, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The reds really stand out against the bleak winter background. I wish the flag wasn''t blurry, but overall, a nice photo.</td>', 'I like the composition. The reds really stand out against the bleak winter background. I wish the flag wasn''t blurry, but overall, a nice photo.', '2006-02-23 22:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177547, 298492, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumping up after second look, although she looks like she is frozen - almost devoid of emotion - kind of...odd to me, but that''s just how it looks to me. I do like the soft tones and color values though.</td>', 'Bumping up after second look, although she looks like she is frozen - almost devoid of emotion - kind of...odd to me, but that''s just how it looks to me. I do like the soft tones and color values though.', '2006-02-23 22:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177550, 298849, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. The lighting seems a bit harsh or maybe it''s because her eyelashes are pitch black, but overall, not bad.</td>', 'I like the concept. The lighting seems a bit harsh or maybe it''s because her eyelashes are pitch black, but overall, not bad.', '2006-02-23 22:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177552, 297797, 29490, '<td valign="top">Top ten, minimum - and that''s an unbiased opinion!</td>', 'Top ten, minimum - and that''s an unbiased opinion!', '2006-02-23 22:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177554, 298844, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think with a different lighting source, this would be a great shot. I feel like there is a car with it''s headlights on in front of him. A bit too bright. Good composition though - looks like he belongs in his surroundings...natural like.</td>', 'I think with a different lighting source, this would be a great shot. I feel like there is a car with it''s headlights on in front of him. A bit too bright. Good composition though - looks like he belongs in his surroundings...natural like.', '2006-02-23 22:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177558, 298512, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, just looks a bit on the magenta side.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, just looks a bit on the magenta side.', '2006-02-23 22:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177562, 297596, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, had I not been able to see the outside street, I would like this better. I do like the dark mannequin against the light one, and the curves of the bent arms makes for some nice negative space shapes.</td>', 'For me, had I not been able to see the outside street, I would like this better. I do like the dark mannequin against the light one, and the curves of the bent arms makes for some nice negative space shapes.', '2006-02-23 22:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177564, 297729, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute image, nice outfit. Her facial expression makes her look much older.</td>', 'Cute image, nice outfit. Her facial expression makes her look much older.', '2006-02-23 22:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177567, 298800, 53164, '<td valign="top">a bit of vignetting in the upper corners. should be easily fixed on PS.</td>', 'a bit of vignetting in the upper corners. should be easily fixed on PS.', '2006-02-23 22:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177568, 298996, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the brightness of the shirt and the shadows. The background frames are okay, but I do find them a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the brightness of the shirt and the shadows. The background frames are okay, but I do find them a little distracting.', '2006-02-23 22:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177570, 296600, 53164, '<td valign="top">unsure watersliding is fashionable. lol</td>', 'unsure watersliding is fashionable. lol', '2006-02-23 22:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177573, 297489, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo is very busy to me. My eyes keep jumping around and don''t know where to "land" so to speak. (Hope that makes sense). The converse are a nice touch with the fishnets - very uhm...fashionable.</td>', 'Your photo is very busy to me. My eyes keep jumping around and don''t know where to "land" so to speak. (Hope that makes sense). The converse are a nice touch with the fishnets - very uhm...fashionable.', '2006-02-23 22:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177575, 298682, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and composition. The lighting seems a bit bright to me. Also, it''s the wrinkles/folds in the background material I find detract from the model.</td>', 'I like the idea and composition. The lighting seems a bit bright to me. Also, it''s the wrinkles/folds in the background material I find detract from the model.', '2006-02-23 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177577, 298827, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute photo of the little tyke.</td>', 'Cute photo of the little tyke.', '2006-02-23 22:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177578, 298755, 53164, '<td valign="top">seems a bit soft. but great shot.</td>', 'seems a bit soft. but great shot.', '2006-02-23 22:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177579, 296886, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good vintage fashion feel with the color values you''ve chosen.</td>', 'Good vintage fashion feel with the color values you''ve chosen.', '2006-02-23 22:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177583, 298584, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at your image for a while now. On one hand I like the angle and composition. On the other hand, every time I look at her face, it looks fake, like a Barbie doll''s head and I can''t quite figure out why. Maybe it''s the lack of emotion...I don''t know....</td>', 'I''ve looked at your image for a while now. On one hand I like the angle and composition. On the other hand, every time I look at her face, it looks fake, like a Barbie doll''s head and I can''t quite figure out why. Maybe it''s the lack of emotion...I don''t know....', '2006-02-23 22:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177587, 297869, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute girl. My least favorite part of your image is the wrinkled background. My favorite parts are her sweet smile and the way her feet are pointed.</td>', 'Cute girl. My least favorite part of your image is the wrinkled background. My favorite parts are her sweet smile and the way her feet are pointed.', '2006-02-23 22:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177592, 298067, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, if there was another object, your image would hold more interest for me. I do like the color values you used though.</td>', 'For me, if there was another object, your image would hold more interest for me. I do like the color values you used though.', '2006-02-23 22:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177600, 298412, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think with a less harsh light source this would be more effective for me and I would have scored it higher. I like he big, bright eyes - and the beaded necklace. :)</td>', 'I think with a less harsh light source this would be more effective for me and I would have scored it higher. I like he big, bright eyes - and the beaded necklace. :)', '2006-02-23 22:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177608, 298274, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your title says it all. Too bad about the hidden face in the background. For me, your photo would have been better without him, but I know with those spur of the moment captures, its hard to eliminate those things.</td>', 'Your title says it all. Too bad about the hidden face in the background. For me, your photo would have been better without him, but I know with those spur of the moment captures, its hard to eliminate those things.', '2006-02-23 22:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177613, 298910, 41675, '<td valign="top">Upon second look, bumping up a point. A nice vintage feel to it, and the longer I look the more I like the composition. Had there been a bit more crispness or focus, I would have scored it even higher.</td>', 'Upon second look, bumping up a point. A nice vintage feel to it, and the longer I look the more I like the composition. Had there been a bit more crispness or focus, I would have scored it even higher.', '2006-02-23 22:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177617, 298798, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like her pose, eyes, and red lipstick. Something about her skin tone though - makes her look...pasty (for lack of a better word).</td>', 'I like her pose, eyes, and red lipstick. Something about her skin tone though - makes her look...pasty (for lack of a better word).', '2006-02-23 22:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177620, 296612, 53164, '<td valign="top">sunrise? fashion?. and its not a very good sunrise pic. taken with your cell phone?</td>', 'sunrise? fashion?. and its not a very good sunrise pic. taken with your cell phone?', '2006-02-23 22:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177623, 298214, 41675, '<td valign="top">A little too oversharpened for my personal tastes and for me, the business of the brush surrounding her is "fighting" for attention from the viewer.</td>', 'A little too oversharpened for my personal tastes and for me, the business of the brush surrounding her is "fighting" for attention from the viewer.', '2006-02-23 22:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177627, 298577, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting is a little too strong, but I like the eyes and facial expression.</td>', 'For me, the lighting is a little too strong, but I like the eyes and facial expression.', '2006-02-23 22:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177637, 296104, 41675, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little bright for me, especially around her fingers and shoulder area, but I like her pose and off-centered composition.</td>', 'The lighting is a little bright for me, especially around her fingers and shoulder area, but I like her pose and off-centered composition.', '2006-02-23 22:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177645, 297980, 41675, '<td valign="top">The thing I like best about your shot is using the same pose as the sign - clever. The lighting is a bit on the yellow/orange side for my personal tastes, and I think it might work better if the letter on the right were cropped out.</td>', 'The thing I like best about your shot is using the same pose as the sign - clever. The lighting is a bit on the yellow/orange side for my personal tastes, and I think it might work better if the letter on the right were cropped out.', '2006-02-23 22:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177655, 296934, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but for some reason, I can''t explain (and this may not make any sense) your composition feels forced...or...stuffy...something about it looks...rigid. Sorry I can''t put it in better terms.</td>', 'I like your idea, but for some reason, I can''t explain (and this may not make any sense) your composition feels forced...or...stuffy...something about it looks...rigid. Sorry I can''t put it in better terms.', '2006-02-23 22:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177656, 298095, 53164, '<td valign="top">perfect.  that is a great shot of the utmost in fashion. well done.</td>', 'perfect.  that is a great shot of the utmost in fashion. well done.', '2006-02-23 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177660, 297643, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this might work better had her body been more partially turned to the camera rather than a straight side shot. Also, the line down the right hand side is very distracting, along with the dark spot by her raised arm.</td>', 'For me, this might work better had her body been more partially turned to the camera rather than a straight side shot. Also, the line down the right hand side is very distracting, along with the dark spot by her raised arm.', '2006-02-23 22:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177665, 297681, 41675, '<td valign="top">The thing I like best about your image is the swordmaster himself. The thing I find detracting is the business of the item behind him - it keeps pulling my attention away from him.</td>', 'The thing I like best about your image is the swordmaster himself. The thing I find detracting is the business of the item behind him - it keeps pulling my attention away from him.', '2006-02-23 22:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177670, 297280, 41675, '<td valign="top">Both of the light lit people stand out to me, but my eyes keep getting drawn to the blurred one and away from what I think was meant to be your main subject, her.</td>', 'Both of the light lit people stand out to me, but my eyes keep getting drawn to the blurred one and away from what I think was meant to be your main subject, her.', '2006-02-23 22:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177677, 298994, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the free feeling pose. The lighting could use some work and I''m not sure what that white string is, but for me, it would be a better image without it.</td>', 'I like the free feeling pose. The lighting could use some work and I''m not sure what that white string is, but for me, it would be a better image without it.', '2006-02-23 22:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177679, 297975, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ah, I think the shirt pretty much says it all. I have a feeling you had fun putting on the most funky things you could find. I especially like the green socks.</td>', 'Ah, I think the shirt pretty much says it all. I have a feeling you had fun putting on the most funky things you could find. I especially like the green socks.', '2006-02-23 22:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
