(2179245, 296832, 48115, '<td valign="top">i like the pose but the redlipstick is a bit to much for me..</td>', 'i like the pose but the redlipstick is a bit to much for me..', '2006-02-24 11:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179246, 297280, 48115, '<td valign="top">humm to unclear coulde have made something out of this.. cam problems i gess :S</td>', 'humm to unclear coulde have made something out of this.. cam problems i gess :S', '2006-02-24 11:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179247, 298684, 7322, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really make me think of fashion. Sorry. It''s a cute photo, if a bit fuzzy in focus.</td>', 'Doesn''t really make me think of fashion. Sorry. It''s a cute photo, if a bit fuzzy in focus.', '2006-02-24 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179249, 298681, 48115, '<td valign="top">the busy background takes away from the girl and her reflection</td>', 'the busy background takes away from the girl and her reflection', '2006-02-24 11:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179253, 298324, 7322, '<td valign="top">Not really getting the fashion angle. This seems more like a social statement. It''s kind of weird with the streaky gloss on one side of her mouth.</td>', 'Not really getting the fashion angle. This seems more like a social statement. It''s kind of weird with the streaky gloss on one side of her mouth.', '2006-02-24 11:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179254, 298768, 48115, '<td valign="top">not sure about the pose but i like the use of ROT and the b&amp;w is good to</td>', 'not sure about the pose but i like the use of ROT and the b&w is good to', '2006-02-24 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179259, 298924, 48115, '<td valign="top">just a bit boring for me.. :S sorry..</td>', 'just a bit boring for me.. :S sorry..', '2006-02-24 11:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179263, 298800, 7322, '<td valign="top">The fashion is kind of cheesy looking but the photo seems well executed. It doesn''t seem to enhance the clothes though.</td>', 'The fashion is kind of cheesy looking but the photo seems well executed. It doesn''t seem to enhance the clothes though.', '2006-02-24 11:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179265, 298535, 7322, '<td valign="top">Pretty model, the fashion looks ''real'', and the style is right for showing off the clothes. Good job.</td>', 'Pretty model, the fashion looks ''real'', and the style is right for showing off the clothes. Good job.', '2006-02-24 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179266, 297915, 48115, '<td valign="top">love to see this a bit further away from her face.. but over all ok</td>', 'love to see this a bit further away from her face.. but over all ok', '2006-02-24 11:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179269, 298029, 7322, '<td valign="top">My eye is drawn more to the colorful bag then her clothes. Her boots, which seem to be the main fashion statement, could be in sharper focus.</td>', 'My eye is drawn more to the colorful bag then her clothes. Her boots, which seem to be the main fashion statement, could be in sharper focus.', '2006-02-24 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179276, 298849, 7322, '<td valign="top">Looks more like boudoir photography then fashion to me. I can''t really see much detail in what she is wearing. I can''t tell if she is standing too close to the background with a fan going crazy on her hair, or if she is lying on a red sheet with her hair spread out. Her skin and hair look faded and washed out. Sorry, the quality just isn''t there for me. Keep at it though!</td>', 'Looks more like boudoir photography then fashion to me. I can''t really see much detail in what she is wearing. I can''t tell if she is standing too close to the background with a fan going crazy on her hair, or if she is lying on a red sheet with her hair spread out. Her skin and hair look faded and washed out. Sorry, the quality just isn''t there for me. Keep at it though!', '2006-02-24 12:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179279, 298682, 7322, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just a bit too overdone on the high key effect. It shows off the sweater nicely though. A really good effort, IMO.</td>', 'Perhaps just a bit too overdone on the high key effect. It shows off the sweater nicely though. A really good effort, IMO.', '2006-02-24 12:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179284, 297813, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit fuzzy and faded out to me. It seems more like a glamour or vanity portrait than a fashion shot. I can''t really see it in a magazine.</td>', 'This looks a bit fuzzy and faded out to me. It seems more like a glamour or vanity portrait than a fashion shot. I can''t really see it in a magazine.', '2006-02-24 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179291, 298951, 7322, '<td valign="top">The pose and the simplicity definitely work for fashion. It seems a teeny bit lacking in sharp detail in the area of his pants and his hands and it seems a tad desaturated. Definitely one of the best I''ve seen so far though.</td>', 'The pose and the simplicity definitely work for fashion. It seems a teeny bit lacking in sharp detail in the area of his pants and his hands and it seems a tad desaturated. Definitely one of the best I''ve seen so far though.', '2006-02-24 12:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179295, 298133, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not really getting the fashion angle here. Wait, I see the feather. I thought that was a weird spike of hair. This isn''t quite working for me as fashion. It''s an interesting personal portrait though.</td>', 'I''m not really getting the fashion angle here. Wait, I see the feather. I thought that was a weird spike of hair. This isn''t quite working for me as fashion. It''s an interesting personal portrait though.', '2006-02-24 12:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179297, 298324, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting concpet and image. Might be a little dark, but I think the end result is a very moody ''feel'' to the pic. Am looking forward to reading your comments to find out how this was achieved.</td>', 'Interesting concpet and image. Might be a little dark, but I think the end result is a very moody ''feel'' to the pic. Am looking forward to reading your comments to find out how this was achieved.', '2006-02-24 12:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179303, 298972, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks pretty authentic as a personality or celebrity spread for a fashion magazine. It could be a little richer looking color-wise. Still, I like the pose, the makeup, the composition, and her confident expression</td>', 'This looks pretty authentic as a personality or celebrity spread for a fashion magazine. It could be a little richer looking color-wise. Still, I like the pose, the makeup, the composition, and her confident expression', '2006-02-24 12:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179304, 298997, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not sure that I get what exactly is ''always in fashion''... the vest and shirt? Peavey sound systems? Bald guys with weird expressions? There''s quite a bit going on in this pic, and while it is optically in focus, conceptually it is a little scattered. So I have to ask, what''s the point? Not as a rhetorical question, but seriously. Where should my attention be drawn when I initially look at this? If it''s the guy, how could he be isolated more from the background to make him the prominent subject? If it''s the clothes, how could that be shown? If it''s the amps, again, how could they be better showcased?</td>', 'Not sure that I get what exactly is ''always in fashion''... the vest and shirt? Peavey sound systems? Bald guys with weird expressions? There''s quite a bit going on in this pic, and while it is optically in focus, conceptually it is a little scattered. So I have to ask, what''s the point? Not as a rhetorical question, but seriously. Where should my attention be drawn when I initially look at this? If it''s the guy, how could he be isolated more from the background to make him the prominent subject? If it''s the clothes, how could that be shown? If it''s the amps, again, how could they be better showcased?', '2006-02-24 12:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179307, 298844, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a cute portrait but it''s not quite working as a fashion shot for me. It''s quite bit lacking in focus on the boy''s face.</td>', 'This is a cute portrait but it''s not quite working as a fashion shot for me. It''s quite bit lacking in focus on the boy''s face.', '2006-02-24 12:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179310, 297779, 7322, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could work in a profile piece for a celebrity hairdresser. Interesting take. A bit blown out looking though.</td>', 'Looks like it could work in a profile piece for a celebrity hairdresser. Interesting take. A bit blown out looking though.', '2006-02-24 12:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179312, 298759, 35645, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of what could be something out of an Off-Off-Broadway play, but in a good way. It has a very "on stage" feel to it. Very interesting.</td>', 'This reminds me of what could be something out of an Off-Off-Broadway play, but in a good way. It has a very "on stage" feel to it. Very interesting.', '2006-02-24 12:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179315, 297597, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cute model, decent fashion. The pose and background work well. It could use sharper focus perhaps? Or maybe just stronger contrast. It seems a bit washed out to me. Still, I find it appealing. In terms of style and composition, it definitelly fits the challenge. I just feel like the image quality could be taken up a notch.</td>', 'Cute model, decent fashion. The pose and background work well. It could use sharper focus perhaps? Or maybe just stronger contrast. It seems a bit washed out to me. Still, I find it appealing. In terms of style and composition, it definitelly fits the challenge. I just feel like the image quality could be taken up a notch.', '2006-02-24 12:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179322, 297136, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the background but I find that it isn''t suited to the fashion that is being presented. It is almost jarring to me. Her pose seems unnatural to me. She doesn''t look comfortable with her leg sticking through the bars like that.</td>', 'I like the background but I find that it isn''t suited to the fashion that is being presented. It is almost jarring to me. Her pose seems unnatural to me. She doesn''t look comfortable with her leg sticking through the bars like that.', '2006-02-24 12:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179325, 298798, 7322, '<td valign="top">She looks a bit too pale--Halloween-like. I''m not really seeing this as a fashion shot. It is more like a personal glamour, or vanity portrait.</td>', 'She looks a bit too pale--Halloween-like. I''m not really seeing this as a fashion shot. It is more like a personal glamour, or vanity portrait.', '2006-02-24 12:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179332, 298572, 7322, '<td valign="top">It''s good fashion and an interesting take. I don''t even mind the heavy shadow from the ''model'' being close to the background (this usually bothers me). That part works because it''s a mannequin. It''s very washed out and lacking in contrast. A good effort.</td>', 'It''s good fashion and an interesting take. I don''t even mind the heavy shadow from the ''model'' being close to the background (this usually bothers me). That part works because it''s a mannequin. It''s very washed out and lacking in contrast. A good effort.', '2006-02-24 12:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179333, 298715, 19672, '<td valign="top">I like th photo, however, if you''re going to dye your hair blonde, um...consider the eyebrows as well....<br/> <br/>*shudder*<br/> <br/>In truth, she probably looks gorgeous in her natural hair color</td>', 'I like th photo, however, if you''re going to dye your hair blonde, um...consider the eyebrows as well.... *shudder* In truth, she probably looks gorgeous in her natural hair color', '2006-02-24 12:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179334, 298133, 19672, '<td valign="top">intriguing</td>', 'intriguing', '2006-02-24 12:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179335, 298972, 19672, '<td valign="top">don''t like how the arm is cut off, makes for the appearance of a floating hand</td>', 'don''t like how the arm is cut off, makes for the appearance of a floating hand', '2006-02-24 12:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179336, 298584, 35645, '<td valign="top">The focus is very odd in this shot. Bits seem to be out of focus, and other adjacent bits which should be in focus are not. Also, there seesm to be some halos around parts of the image - the right knee and thigh, the left shoulder, a couple of other spots. The composition is interesting, and I think it would be more so if the focus issues were not there.</td>', 'The focus is very odd in this shot. Bits seem to be out of focus, and other adjacent bits which should be in focus are not. Also, there seesm to be some halos around parts of the image - the right knee and thigh, the left shoulder, a couple of other spots. The composition is interesting, and I think it would be more so if the focus issues were not there.', '2006-02-24 12:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179337, 298324, 19672, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting...intriguing...</td>', 'Like the lighting...intriguing...', '2006-02-24 12:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179338, 296988, 19672, '<td valign="top">Too many shadow on the right.  Otherwise I like the color and the poise...</td>', 'Too many shadow on the right.  Otherwise I like the color and the poise...', '2006-02-24 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179340, 297681, 35645, '<td valign="top">WHile this is an interesting subject and a different take on the challenge, I think this could be made more interesting (and perhaps a little less visually distracting in the background) by shooting from a slightly different angle.</td>', 'WHile this is an interesting subject and a different take on the challenge, I think this could be made more interesting (and perhaps a little less visually distracting in the background) by shooting from a slightly different angle.', '2006-02-24 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179342, 298991, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks really bad on my monitor. The left side of the image looks weirdly glowing and soft focus. The other side of the jacket is overblown in the highlights and his face is out of focus. In terms of fashion, composition, style, and the look of the model it all works. It just seems to be strongly lacking in image quality.</td>', 'This looks really bad on my monitor. The left side of the image looks weirdly glowing and soft focus. The other side of the jacket is overblown in the highlights and his face is out of focus. In terms of fashion, composition, style, and the look of the model it all works. It just seems to be strongly lacking in image quality.', '2006-02-24 12:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179348, 296832, 35645, '<td valign="top">Love the framing here. The ecpression on her face makes her look a little bored, but the more I think about that, the more it reminds me of a lot of expressions I''ve seen in the fashion mags.</td>', 'Love the framing here. The ecpression on her face makes her look a little bored, but the more I think about that, the more it reminds me of a lot of expressions I''ve seen in the fashion mags.', '2006-02-24 12:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179349, 296491, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think of this as more of a boudoir or vanity shot than a fashion shot. The soft focus is a bit overdone. A fashion shot should show off the clothes and this just doesn''t do that.</td>', 'I think of this as more of a boudoir or vanity shot than a fashion shot. The soft focus is a bit overdone. A fashion shot should show off the clothes and this just doesn''t do that.', '2006-02-24 12:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179350, 298082, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cute model and fun fashion. It could look a bit richer in terms of texture and color.</td>', 'Cute model and fun fashion. It could look a bit richer in terms of texture and color.', '2006-02-24 12:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179352, 297489, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. Very different point of view, both with the picture and the concept behind the picture.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. Very different point of view, both with the picture and the concept behind the picture.', '2006-02-24 12:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179354, 298834, 7322, '<td valign="top">The image quality of this is just terrible, I''m sorry to say. It''s very unfocused. I''m not sure what I''m looking at. A bottle of cologne and a candle. This isn''t really presenting a product in a sellable way.</td>', 'The image quality of this is just terrible, I''m sorry to say. It''s very unfocused. I''m not sure what I''m looking at. A bottle of cologne and a candle. This isn''t really presenting a product in a sellable way.', '2006-02-24 12:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179356, 297065, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is more of what I think of as a boudoir shot than a fashion shot. Maybe I''d see this in a certain type of mens'' magazine but not a fashion magazine. It''s just cheesy looking to me.</td>', 'This is more of what I think of as a boudoir shot than a fashion shot. Maybe I''d see this in a certain type of mens'' magazine but not a fashion magazine. It''s just cheesy looking to me.', '2006-02-24 12:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179357, 297729, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is a charming photo, I just wish the focus wasn''t quite so soft!</td>', 'This is a charming photo, I just wish the focus wasn''t quite so soft!', '2006-02-24 12:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179359, 297980, 7322, '<td valign="top">He''s cute and I like the composition. Sadly, there isn''t enough exposure on his face and nothing appears to be in focus.</td>', 'He''s cute and I like the composition. Sadly, there isn''t enough exposure on his face and nothing appears to be in focus.', '2006-02-24 12:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179365, 298537, 7322, '<td valign="top">I could imagine this in an Anthropologie catalog maybe. It could use a bit sharper focus in the details of her face and her shirt but overall it''s a really great effort.</td>', 'I could imagine this in an Anthropologie catalog maybe. It could use a bit sharper focus in the details of her face and her shirt but overall it''s a really great effort.', '2006-02-24 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179367, 298619, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting the fashion angle from this.</td>', 'I''m not getting the fashion angle from this.', '2006-02-24 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179368, 298412, 35645, '<td valign="top">Definately a cutie! I''m not sure I care for the overall brightness - in this case I don''t think it really ''fits'' with the subject being all ''dressed up''. I think this treament would work better with her dressed up as, say, an angel, or perhaps a flower girl or something. Here it just washes out the ''painting'' she''s been doing.</td>', 'Definately a cutie! I''m not sure I care for the overall brightness - in this case I don''t think it really ''fits'' with the subject being all ''dressed up''. I think this treament would work better with her dressed up as, say, an angel, or perhaps a flower girl or something. Here it just washes out the ''painting'' she''s been doing.', '2006-02-24 12:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179374, 297823, 7322, '<td valign="top">The shoes are kind of beat up for a fashion spread. I don''t like the mismatched pairing of them. Also, this looks like the contrast was increased to disguise poor focus or image quality. Sorry, this just doesn''t work for me on any level. Keep trying.</td>', 'The shoes are kind of beat up for a fashion spread. I don''t like the mismatched pairing of them. Also, this looks like the contrast was increased to disguise poor focus or image quality. Sorry, this just doesn''t work for me on any level. Keep trying.', '2006-02-24 12:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179377, 298200, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It looks like it could be in an Anthrolopologie catalog.  I like the setting, the color, the fashion...well done.</td>', 'Very nice. It looks like it could be in an Anthrolopologie catalog.  I like the setting, the color, the fashion...well done.', '2006-02-24 12:37:14.000000', NULL, 1);
