(2179640, 298293, 19672, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like this look. And the model''s pose furthers my dis-interest (why she died her hair to such an unnatural and distracting color is beyond me).<br/> <br/>Her hand looks large and muscular and looks to be pushing her face off. There is way too much make up and the coloring is all off.<br/> <br/>The background is distracting as it changes right in the middle.<br/> <br/>eh....<br/> <br/>Too many elements just rub me the wrong way with this.  And yet everything says potential setup for an excellent photo.</td>', 'I really don''t like this look. And the model''s pose furthers my dis-interest (why she died her hair to such an unnatural and distracting color is beyond me). Her hand looks large and muscular and looks to be pushing her face off. There is way too much make up and the coloring is all off. The background is distracting as it changes right in the middle. eh.... Too many elements just rub me the wrong way with this.  And yet everything says potential setup for an excellent photo.', '2006-02-24 14:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
