(2180162, 297061, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is different and interesting. I like the concept, but I think that the camera angle makes her hips and thighs look larger than they really are. The B&amp;W gives this a stark in-your-face look that is very ''fashion''. I can''t help but wonder, though, if this wouldn''t have more impact if you used less light, oversaturated the color, and ran a grunge filter on it. I know - not legal in basic, but I still wonder.<br/>As it stands, it''s unique in the challenge, and I think it could hold its own in a magazine. Well done.</td>', 'This is different and interesting. I like the concept, but I think that the camera angle makes her hips and thighs look larger than they really are. The B&W gives this a stark in-your-face look that is very ''fashion''. I can''t help but wonder, though, if this wouldn''t have more impact if you used less light, oversaturated the color, and ran a grunge filter on it. I know - not legal in basic, but I still wonder.As it stands, it''s unique in the challenge, and I think it could hold its own in a magazine. Well done.', '2006-02-24 17:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
