(2180228, 298925, 7322, '<td valign="top">Fashion? Not really. This is more of a sociological or travel study. The color balance could be a bit warmer. Her skin has an ashy washed out appearance. She has a great smile though.</td>', 'Fashion? Not really. This is more of a sociological or travel study. The color balance could be a bit warmer. Her skin has an ashy washed out appearance. She has a great smile though.', '2006-02-24 18:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
