(2180248, 298866, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice....not exactly great fashion (square-toe boots? no way) but the photographic style is works for a fashion editorial. The kitchen-tile-looking floor and the big light colored knobby feet on the loveseat throw the high style quotient off a lot. Basically, I like the idea and mood--it just leaves something to be desired in regards to the style of the content.</td>', 'Very nice....not exactly great fashion (square-toe boots? no way) but the photographic style is works for a fashion editorial. The kitchen-tile-looking floor and the big light colored knobby feet on the loveseat throw the high style quotient off a lot. Basically, I like the idea and mood--it just leaves something to be desired in regards to the style of the content.', '2006-02-24 18:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180254, 298732, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is very out of focus and I don''t see the fashion focus. It looks like it was submitted for the sake of entering a challenge.</td>', 'This is very out of focus and I don''t see the fashion focus. It looks like it was submitted for the sake of entering a challenge.', '2006-02-24 18:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180268, 298992, 7322, '<td valign="top">The clothes are pretty pedestrian and boring but the photo has a certain fashion editorial mood. The model is attractive. His navel looks kind of unappealing peaking out from behind the tie. I''d rather see all or none. This little spot of it is distracting and odd--like a third eye coming out of his bellly.</td>', 'The clothes are pretty pedestrian and boring but the photo has a certain fashion editorial mood. The model is attractive. His navel looks kind of unappealing peaking out from behind the tie. I''d rather see all or none. This little spot of it is distracting and odd--like a third eye coming out of his bellly.', '2006-02-24 18:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180279, 298577, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t tres chic, if you''ll forgive the bluntness. This looks more like a glamour or vanity portrait than something I''d see in a fashion magazine, and unfortunately for this attractive woman, not a very good one. I could have done without the duotone. The model needs to be placed furthur away from the background to avoid the ''big hair'' effect created by dark shadow directly behind her. Her skin tones are quite washed out do to overexposure. Try again, keeping her placement in relation to her background in mind and filtering the flash a bit with some wax paper taped over it.</td>', 'This isn''t tres chic, if you''ll forgive the bluntness. This looks more like a glamour or vanity portrait than something I''d see in a fashion magazine, and unfortunately for this attractive woman, not a very good one. I could have done without the duotone. The model needs to be placed furthur away from the background to avoid the ''big hair'' effect created by dark shadow directly behind her. Her skin tones are quite washed out do to overexposure. Try again, keeping her placement in relation to her background in mind and filtering the flash a bit with some wax paper taped over it.', '2006-02-24 18:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180308, 298994, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a casual portrait. I''m not seeing the fashion angle at all. Showing a trend in a photo (and a pretty tired trend at that) doesn''t equal fashion photography. There is a certain feel to a fashion editorial. I don''t expect the same level of quality as, say Vogue or Elle, but the spirit should be there in terms of composition and style. I have to be able to at least imagine seeing the photo in a magazine. <br/> <br/> <br/>In terms of strict photographic merit this isn''t too bad but it could be better. The white thing growing out of her head is very distracting. Sepia isn''t working for me at all. The mood that sepia tends to impart doesn''t have much to do with this subject matter---it seems like a random choice rather than a well-considered one. Next time, try placing your subject further away from the background to avoid the halo shadow effect. Better lighting and focus is needed to bring out more sparkle (or ''catch light) in her eyes which look very flat in this photo.</td>', 'This is a casual portrait. I''m not seeing the fashion angle at all. Showing a trend in a photo (and a pretty tired trend at that) doesn''t equal fashion photography. There is a certain feel to a fashion editorial. I don''t expect the same level of quality as, say Vogue or Elle, but the spirit should be there in terms of composition and style. I have to be able to at least imagine seeing the photo in a magazine.   In terms of strict photographic merit this isn''t too bad but it could be better. The white thing growing out of her head is very distracting. Sepia isn''t working for me at all. The mood that sepia tends to impart doesn''t have much to do with this subject matter---it seems like a random choice rather than a well-considered one. Next time, try placing your subject further away from the background to avoid the halo shadow effect. Better lighting and focus is needed to bring out more sparkle (or ''catch light) in her eyes which look very flat in this photo.', '2006-02-24 18:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180316, 298997, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was submitted just to have something entered. It seems more about the Peavy amps than fashion. Judging strictly by the tux, this looks like a wedding entertainer or guest. The image is really grainy in the area of his pants.</td>', 'This looks like it was submitted just to have something entered. It seems more about the Peavy amps than fashion. Judging strictly by the tux, this looks like a wedding entertainer or guest. The image is really grainy in the area of his pants.', '2006-02-24 18:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180325, 298562, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was submitted just to have something entered. I don''t want to appear ''age-ist'' but really, I just can''t imagine ever seeing this in a fashion magazine, or even a fashion spread in AARP''s magazine. The style content just isn''t there for one thing. As a sociological study or an unusual portrait of a loved one it''s okay.</td>', 'This looks like it was submitted just to have something entered. I don''t want to appear ''age-ist'' but really, I just can''t imagine ever seeing this in a fashion magazine, or even a fashion spread in AARP''s magazine. The style content just isn''t there for one thing. As a sociological study or an unusual portrait of a loved one it''s okay.', '2006-02-24 18:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180347, 298888, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not really seeing this as a fashion shot. What fashion is being presented here? Even if it''s an ad for hosiery, this is too abstract to properly show off the product. It is an interesting shot in terms of abstraction and art but it doesn''t work for me as fashion.</td>', 'I''m not really seeing this as a fashion shot. What fashion is being presented here? Even if it''s an ad for hosiery, this is too abstract to properly show off the product. It is an interesting shot in terms of abstraction and art but it doesn''t work for me as fashion.', '2006-02-24 19:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180350, 297681, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sociololgical, maybe. Travel, definitely. Fashion? No way.</td>', 'Sociololgical, maybe. Travel, definitely. Fashion? No way.', '2006-02-24 19:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180356, 298274, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sociological study but not fashion photography. Also, it is kind of a random point and shoot sort of photo that seems to be just about recording the guy''s hairstyle. It doesn''t seem to be a well-considered composition. The face in the background is very distracting.</td>', 'Sociological study but not fashion photography. Also, it is kind of a random point and shoot sort of photo that seems to be just about recording the guy''s hairstyle. It doesn''t seem to be a well-considered composition. The face in the background is very distracting.', '2006-02-24 19:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180362, 298990, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great model (she''s actually pretty and has up-to-date hair), good fashion (even accessories!) and fun setting. Works for me. Her top could have a bit more detail (it''s a tad overexposed).</td>', 'Great model (she''s actually pretty and has up-to-date hair), good fashion (even accessories!) and fun setting. Works for me. Her top could have a bit more detail (it''s a tad overexposed).', '2006-02-24 19:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180363, 297797, 7322, '<td valign="top">Boudoir photo, yes. Fashion? Not really.</td>', 'Boudoir photo, yes. Fashion? Not really.', '2006-02-24 19:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180370, 298214, 7322, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t have the feel of a fashion editorial to me. I can''t recall the last time I saw selective desaturation in a fashion spread (if ever). There are a lot of artifacts in this image, particularly around her arm, the belt and her face. She''s a cute model though.</td>', 'This doesn''t have the feel of a fashion editorial to me. I can''t recall the last time I saw selective desaturation in a fashion spread (if ever). There are a lot of artifacts in this image, particularly around her arm, the belt and her face. She''s a cute model though.', '2006-02-24 19:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180375, 298293, 7322, '<td valign="top">Eek! The skin tone of her face doesn''t match the rest of her. Her hand near her face is several shades lighter! Very unappealing. Someone overdid it on the pancake or the bronzer. This looks like a boudoir photo. I can''t really imagine this in a fashion magazine. Maybe Fredericks of Hollywood?</td>', 'Eek! The skin tone of her face doesn''t match the rest of her. Her hand near her face is several shades lighter! Very unappealing. Someone overdid it on the pancake or the bronzer. This looks like a boudoir photo. I can''t really imagine this in a fashion magazine. Maybe Fredericks of Hollywood?', '2006-02-24 19:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2180379, 298680, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cool shoe. This shot isn''t really screaming ''fashion photography'' to me though.</td>', 'Cool shoe. This shot isn''t really screaming ''fashion photography'' to me though.', '2006-02-24 19:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
