(2182205, 298528, 39664, '<td valign="top">Fashion police?</td>', 'Fashion police?', '2006-02-25 14:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2182206, 297079, 39664, '<td valign="top">If the tie is askew, then loosen the knot and collar.  Otherwise, line it up with the buttons on the shirt.  A shot should be casual or formal but this stands out as a mistake.  Nice shot and cute model.</td>', 'If the tie is askew, then loosen the knot and collar.  Otherwise, line it up with the buttons on the shirt.  A shot should be casual or formal but this stands out as a mistake.  Nice shot and cute model.', '2006-02-25 14:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2182207, 297445, 43405, '<td valign="top">This is really good. Bet this will be a top finisher.</td>', 'This is really good. Bet this will be a top finisher.', '2006-02-25 14:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2182211, 297797, 39664, '<td valign="top">I find the black framing too restricting for this dreamy style shot.  The whites are a bit harsh.  I think a softer framing would have made this shot, possibly a blurring out effect rather than the harsh frame pinning it in.  Plus, if this shot is about the make-up, shouldn''t the focus be more on her face?  My eyes are drawn to the tatoos and the white dress.</td>', 'I find the black framing too restricting for this dreamy style shot.  The whites are a bit harsh.  I think a softer framing would have made this shot, possibly a blurring out effect rather than the harsh frame pinning it in.  Plus, if this shot is about the make-up, shouldn''t the focus be more on her face?  My eyes are drawn to the tatoos and the white dress.', '2006-02-25 14:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2182212, 298492, 39664, '<td valign="top">I see this is more PORTRAITURE than Fashion.  Maybe if she were holding up a pretty bottle of perfume?</td>', 'I see this is more PORTRAITURE than Fashion.  Maybe if she were holding up a pretty bottle of perfume?', '2006-02-25 14:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
