(2182217, 297597, 39664, '<td valign="top">Handsome but I''m not liking the b/g.  The snow and siding disect him thru the legs then where the siding is joined up higher, disect him thru the eyes.  Maybe only getting the blue siding (great texture for a b/g) and not the snow would have improved this shot, IMHO.</td>', 'Handsome but I''m not liking the b/g.  The snow and siding disect him thru the legs then where the siding is joined up higher, disect him thru the eyes.  Maybe only getting the blue siding (great texture for a b/g) and not the snow would have improved this shot, IMHO.', '2006-02-25 14:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
