(2182520, 298972, 39664, '<td valign="top"><i>Terpsichore the "Whirler" is the muse of dancing and is often seen dancing with her lyre and a plectrum, an instrument used for plucking stringed instruments. By the river god Achelous, she bore the Sirens.</i> <br/> <br/>Nice faceshot but I don''t feel like your title portrays the shot.  That aside, excellent lighting, focus and comp.  This could be an ad for Dove moisturizing products or similar.  One tiny picky thing...her neck and face color don''t match.<br/> <br/>Bumping up after 2nd pass and comments.</td>', 'Terpsichore the "Whirler" is the muse of dancing and is often seen dancing with her lyre and a plectrum, an instrument used for plucking stringed instruments. By the river god Achelous, she bore the Sirens.  Nice faceshot but I don''t feel like your title portrays the shot.  That aside, excellent lighting, focus and comp.  This could be an ad for Dove moisturizing products or similar.  One tiny picky thing...her neck and face color don''t match. Bumping up after 2nd pass and comments.', '2006-02-25 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2182521, 297729, 39664, '<td valign="top">Very cute with attitude!  Such a grown-up face too!</td>', 'Very cute with attitude!  Such a grown-up face too!', '2006-02-25 16:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2182527, 296832, 39664, '<td valign="top">Would this be for the glasses or the jewelry or make-up?  This more looks like a senior portrait because of all the distracting elements.  If you were thinking glasses, lose the earrings and necklace or vis a versa.  If you were thinking make-up, loose all the accessories, including the glasses.  Hope this helps and as always, this is all just IMHO.</td>', 'Would this be for the glasses or the jewelry or make-up?  This more looks like a senior portrait because of all the distracting elements.  If you were thinking glasses, lose the earrings and necklace or vis a versa.  If you were thinking make-up, loose all the accessories, including the glasses.  Hope this helps and as always, this is all just IMHO.', '2006-02-25 16:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
