(2184665, 298972, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like how your eye starts with her face, follows her arm on the right up and back to her face again. Neat composition. Also, like the highlights in her eyes. 10</td>', 'I like how your eye starts with her face, follows her arm on the right up and back to her face again. Neat composition. Also, like the highlights in her eyes. 10', '2006-02-26 16:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
