(2184671, 298043, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat and she wears her necklace well! :) The purple heart is a nice compliment to the gorgeous ambers of her eyes and hair. VERY sharp, well lit and nice highlights in her eyes. Like how you cropped it. 8 <br/>Second pass...impressed with the deep, rich colors and clarity. Bumping. 10</td>', 'Beautiful cat and she wears her necklace well! :) The purple heart is a nice compliment to the gorgeous ambers of her eyes and hair. VERY sharp, well lit and nice highlights in her eyes. Like how you cropped it. 8 Second pass...impressed with the deep, rich colors and clarity. Bumping. 10', '2006-02-26 16:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2184679, 298136, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the intensity of expression you captured in her eyes. The big hair is great, and the gentle smile is perfect. Wel cropped.  8</td>', 'Like the intensity of expression you captured in her eyes. The big hair is great, and the gentle smile is perfect. Wel cropped.  8', '2006-02-26 16:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
