(2185250, 298293, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well captured. these images are very difficult when we bring the hands up to the makeup face and the hand skin pales. Nevertheless, the image remains interesting because of the model''s good poise. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very well captured. these images are very difficult when we bring the hands up to the makeup face and the hand skin pales. Nevertheless, the image remains interesting because of the model''s good poise. Bumping up.', '2006-02-26 20:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
