(2187803, 298535, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting in this one.  A very good looking model and hot clothing.  Perhaps some extra space on the left would make the shot feel less tight?  Anyway one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice lighting in this one.  A very good looking model and hot clothing.  Perhaps some extra space on the left would make the shot feel less tight?  Anyway one of the best in the challenge.', '2006-02-27 17:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187806, 296915, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good idea well executed.  Great colors and lighting.</td>', 'Good idea well executed.  Great colors and lighting.', '2006-02-27 17:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187810, 298200, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good play with color and texture.</td>', 'Good play with color and texture.', '2006-02-27 17:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187843, 298133, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this, but the angle of the face just isn''t flattering. Maybe more of a 3/4 or 2/3 profile would work better than the almost complete profile view.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this, but the angle of the face just isn''t flattering. Maybe more of a 3/4 or 2/3 profile would work better than the almost complete profile view.', '2006-02-27 17:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187851, 298680, 35645, '<td valign="top">An unusual shoe, to be sure, but a very static and awkward angle and crop. I think a more appealing composition would be her seated, either in profile or facing the camera, with her legs crossed and the feet held away from the body slightly. That could be cropped just above the knees and still keep in line with the concept of the shot, yet be more appealing to the viewer and more flattering to the model.</td>', 'An unusual shoe, to be sure, but a very static and awkward angle and crop. I think a more appealing composition would be her seated, either in profile or facing the camera, with her legs crossed and the feet held away from the body slightly. That could be cropped just above the knees and still keep in line with the concept of the shot, yet be more appealing to the viewer and more flattering to the model.', '2006-02-27 17:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187888, 297065, 40718, '<td valign="top">I will tell you I cannot take my eyes off this gal.  She is very sexy.  The picture is well done with the stark contrasts between the red wall and the black couch.  In true ''fashion'' style, the dress is, of course, ridiculous.  The choker/necklace is a nice touch as is the pose. Her pout, makeup and hair are superb.  My favorite for the challenge. 10</td>', 'I will tell you I cannot take my eyes off this gal.  She is very sexy.  The picture is well done with the stark contrasts between the red wall and the black couch.  In true ''fashion'' style, the dress is, of course, ridiculous.  The choker/necklace is a nice touch as is the pose. Her pout, makeup and hair are superb.  My favorite for the challenge. 10', '2006-02-27 18:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187895, 296650, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very professional lighting.  I can''t tell if this is going to be a Dr. JOnes or not, but it''s up to par with his work. 9</td>', 'Very professional lighting.  I can''t tell if this is going to be a Dr. JOnes or not, but it''s up to par with his work. 9', '2006-02-27 18:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187900, 297422, 40718, '<td valign="top">A neat idea.  I wish the lighting was a little warmer and the crop a little tighter.  I would have either moved or cropped the girl on the far left and cut the picture at the end of the pool cue. 7 for effort.</td>', 'A neat idea.  I wish the lighting was a little warmer and the crop a little tighter.  I would have either moved or cropped the girl on the far left and cut the picture at the end of the pool cue. 7 for effort.', '2006-02-27 18:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187905, 298275, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I bet you are getting a polarized voting pattern on this one.  The lighting is well done as is the sharpness.  I wish he''d shaved some of the straggle whiskers off his neck.  For basic editing, nicely done. 8</td>', 'Very interesting.  I bet you are getting a polarized voting pattern on this one.  The lighting is well done as is the sharpness.  I wish he''d shaved some of the straggle whiskers off his neck.  For basic editing, nicely done. 8', '2006-02-27 18:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187916, 297135, 40718, '<td valign="top">I know it''s a pain, but iron the sheets when they serve as backdrops.  Looks like fun was had during this shoot. Nice lighting on her face.</td>', 'I know it''s a pain, but iron the sheets when they serve as backdrops.  Looks like fun was had during this shoot. Nice lighting on her face.', '2006-02-27 18:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187933, 298535, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, pose and the hair gives dynamics. 8</td>', 'Very nice lighting, pose and the hair gives dynamics. 8', '2006-02-27 18:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187935, 298623, 40718, '<td valign="top">He''s a hottie.  I like the chiaroscuro effect.  Nice composition. 8</td>', 'He''s a hottie.  I like the chiaroscuro effect.  Nice composition. 8', '2006-02-27 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187939, 296832, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of her with the worn wood.  Very sharp.  Just a tad overexposed on her pink undershirt.  Very nicely lit on her face. 8</td>', 'I like the contrast of her with the worn wood.  Very sharp.  Just a tad overexposed on her pink undershirt.  Very nicely lit on her face. 8', '2006-02-27 18:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187942, 297980, 40718, '<td valign="top">A great attempt, but he is too dark and not sharp enough.  The picture in the back looks sharper than he does.  I would also have cropped the yellow letter out on the right.  Maybe you could have used a small light on his right or a reflector to give the rest of his face a little detail.</td>', 'A great attempt, but he is too dark and not sharp enough.  The picture in the back looks sharper than he does.  I would also have cropped the yellow letter out on the right.  Maybe you could have used a small light on his right or a reflector to give the rest of his face a little detail.', '2006-02-27 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187944, 298991, 40718, '<td valign="top">Not enough DOF.  The whole right of his suit is confusing, it looks very blurred and I don''t like the effect.  HIs face also should be in sharper focus.</td>', 'Not enough DOF.  The whole right of his suit is confusing, it looks very blurred and I don''t like the effect.  HIs face also should be in sharper focus.', '2006-02-27 18:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
