(2190651, 298002, 332, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this picture the first thing I thought was "I''ve seen this one before". Didn''t know where until a few days ago. There was this singing contest in Iceland for the Eurovision contest. Some photographer took pictures of the contestants and one of the picture looks very simular to this one. <a href="//arnit.mis.is/dpc/birgitta.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here is a link to the picture.</a> Just wanted to share this with you. It is amazing that two people get the exact idea.</td>', 'When I first saw this picture the first thing I thought was "I''ve seen this one before". Didn''t know where until a few days ago. There was this singing contest in Iceland for the Eurovision contest. Some photographer took pictures of the contestants and one of the picture looks very simular to this one. Here is a link to the picture. Just wanted to share this with you. It is amazing that two people get the exact idea.', '2006-02-28 20:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190675, 298136, 332, '<td valign="top">You should always use the full 640px that is allowed in the challanges. This one would rate much higher if it were 640px instead of the 480px. This is one of the best pictures in the challange but people will rate it low because of the size. One minor detail. The hair that is lit up in her armpit bothers me a bit. I know it is just alit hair from her head :) Good luck. I will not rate it any lower because of the size of it.</td>', 'You should always use the full 640px that is allowed in the challanges. This one would rate much higher if it were 640px instead of the 480px. This is one of the best pictures in the challange but people will rate it low because of the size. One minor detail. The hair that is lit up in her armpit bothers me a bit. I know it is just alit hair from her head :) Good luck. I will not rate it any lower because of the size of it.', '2006-02-28 20:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190680, 298759, 332, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challange. I would like to have seen this one with a square crop. A bit more black on the top and a bit less on the left. Great picture! Congrats. I''m thinking top 5.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challange. I would like to have seen this one with a square crop. A bit more black on the top and a bit less on the left. Great picture! Congrats. I''m thinking top 5.', '2006-02-28 21:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190705, 297823, 39664, '<td valign="top">The lighting is so uneven and it makes the shot very flat.</td>', 'The lighting is so uneven and it makes the shot very flat.', '2006-02-28 21:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190715, 297895, 39664, '<td valign="top">In a fashion shot, you need a focal point....what are you trying to "sell".  The eyes?  The necklace?  The eye makeup is cool and you could make this more edgy had you concentrated on more on her eyes and didn''t have the severe sideways glance happening.  I could see this as a standing shot, shoulders rolled back or forward, facing into a fan blowing her hair back and the face 3/4 turned, over her shoulder.  That would display the make-up and the necklace, even tho the makeup is enough.  This, of course, is all MHO.</td>', 'In a fashion shot, you need a focal point....what are you trying to "sell".  The eyes?  The necklace?  The eye makeup is cool and you could make this more edgy had you concentrated on more on her eyes and didn''t have the severe sideways glance happening.  I could see this as a standing shot, shoulders rolled back or forward, facing into a fan blowing her hair back and the face 3/4 turned, over her shoulder.  That would display the make-up and the necklace, even tho the makeup is enough.  This, of course, is all MHO.', '2006-02-28 21:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
