(2190727, 297065, 39664, '<td valign="top">Note the angle of her front leg....it''s distorted by the angle of the shot, making her leg look larger thank it probably is.  Since the other leg is tucked, the boots are really not necessary....cutting her leg line.  Another distraction from the shot is the couch line and the red background....it cuts into the shot also.  Nice sultry look but the lighting is uneven on her eyes.  Also the angle of her right hand is too severe, making it appear more detached from her arm</td>', 'Note the angle of her front leg....it''s distorted by the angle of the shot, making her leg look larger thank it probably is.  Since the other leg is tucked, the boots are really not necessary....cutting her leg line.  Another distraction from the shot is the couch line and the red background....it cuts into the shot also.  Nice sultry look but the lighting is uneven on her eyes.  Also the angle of her right hand is too severe, making it appear more detached from her arm', '2006-02-28 21:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
