(2191067, 297445, 42984, '<td valign="top">Well done, this is a great image.  I know English isn''t your first language but I do feel strongly about photographers sharing the story of how they got their picture. That is the basis for the strong community feeling of DPC. To always refuse to share with others looks like you are here just to take votes and not give anything back.  You don''t even feel committed enough to the community to share you shutter and aperture settings. There, I feel better now.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-01 00:18:11.</i></td>', 'Well done, this is a great image.  I know English isn''t your first language but I do feel strongly about photographers sharing the story of how they got their picture. That is the basis for the strong community feeling of DPC. To always refuse to share with others looks like you are here just to take votes and not give anything back.  You don''t even feel committed enough to the community to share you shutter and aperture settings. There, I feel better now.', '2006-03-01 00:11:47.000000', '2006-03-01 00:18:11.000000', 0),
