(2191820, 296650, 53964, '<td valign="top">Just reading all the nipple comments, I had to add mine... I didn''t even notice it until about my 3rd go over the photo! My first thought was, "Wow, I love the shape of her face, cute nose." Second was, "I love the outfit, wish I could wear something like that!". It was as I looked at the detail of the outfit and how it supported her to give such perfect shaping that I noticed it, so personally *I* don''t think it was a huge distraction. Then again, I''m not male.... ;)</td>', 'Just reading all the nipple comments, I had to add mine... I didn''t even notice it until about my 3rd go over the photo! My first thought was, "Wow, I love the shape of her face, cute nose." Second was, "I love the outfit, wish I could wear something like that!". It was as I looked at the detail of the outfit and how it supported her to give such perfect shaping that I noticed it, so personally *I* don''t think it was a huge distraction. Then again, I''m not male.... ;)', '2006-03-01 03:42:05.000000', NULL, 0),
