(2193499, 298205, 24744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by magnus:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice, but I still like Sahko''s subtler version better </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''d not seen that before... however, the effect i was going for was quite different.  I wanted the spray to glow, and the rest of the frame to be darkness, and the focus to not be on the model.  Also i wanted the spray to be real, clear and concrete, rather than a photoshopped blur :)</td>', 'Originally posted by magnus: Very nice, but I still like Sahko''s subtler version better   I''d not seen that before... however, the effect i was going for was quite different.  I wanted the spray to glow, and the rest of the frame to be darkness, and the focus to not be on the model.  Also i wanted the spray to be real, clear and concrete, rather than a photoshopped blur :)', '2006-03-01 14:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
